:26Z","email":"pointerbyte21@outlook.com","name":"Manuel Garcia Blanco"},"message":"feat: enhance HTTP logging with customizable health endpoint and request context\n\n- Added `healthHandler` option to `newHttpServer` for customizable health responses.\n- Introduced `httpContext` middleware for request-scoped context and W3C trace propagation.\n- Implemented `buildHttpLogEntry` for direct logging from handlers.\n- Enhanced `httpLogger` to support path exclusions, header inclusion options, and logging predicates.\n- Added tests for new features and ensured compatibility with existing functionality.\n- Updated version to 0.0.9 and documented changes in CHANGELOG.md.","tree":{"sha":"10dcfb08fc56e45d6f43f06ce9b0122af182e747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PointerByte/DenoForge/git/trees/10dcfb08fc56e45d6f43f06ce9b0122af182e747"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PointerByte/DenoForge/git/commits/dddd359e4998388ad4a3be31576e5650619054c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60157724?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PointerByte","id":60157724,"login":"PointerByte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTU3NzI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/user