hotmail.com","name":"Manuel Garcia Blanco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T04:07:13Z","email":"many_mgb_21@hotmail.com","name":"Manuel Garcia Blanco"},"message":"feat(security): add JWT and cookie authentication middlewares\n\n- Implemented context middleware for managing authenticated claims.\n- Added cookie middleware for JWT authentication via cookies.\n- Created gRPC interceptor for JWT authentication in unary RPC calls.\n- Developed security headers middleware to apply security headers to responses.\n- Introduced bearer-token JWT middleware for extracting and verifying tokens from Authorization headers.\n- Created a comprehensive security module to export all authentication and middleware functionalities.\n\nfeat(tools): implement job scheduling and worker utilities\n\n- Developed a job scheduling system with fixed-interval and cron job capabilities.\n- Created a bounded worker loop to manage concurrent task execution with a configurable limit.\n- Added tests for job scheduling and worker functionalities to ensure reliability and correctness.\n- Implemented a shared test mode flag to suppress background work during tests.","tree":{"sha":"482e9369b56add9c2dcb16845988fce996514bf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PointerByte/DenoForge/git/trees/482e9369b56add9c2dcb16845988fce996514bf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PointerByte/DenoForge/git/commits/974ca607434a04b17c834ba47beac2a862ed2a43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60157724?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PointerByte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PointerByte","id":6015772