态到持久化领域模型的完整落地：\n1.  新增知识库、文档、分片的领域实体定义与Repository实现，基于localStorage实现持久化\n2.  创建知识Pinia状态管理仓库，管理工作区知识库、文档、分片与检索状态\n3.  重构知识中心页面，替换原内存状态为使用持久化仓库数据\n4.  实现聊天运行时注入选中的应用知识库能力，支持RAG检索\n5.  新增知识库单元测试覆盖核心流程\n6.  更新产品文档，更新迭代计划与验收标准","tree":{"sha":"5702112e82fbd3de877f3e4fa072b6b7ed4d7efe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/novedu/enterprise-admin-kit/git/trees/5702112e82fbd3de877f3e4fa072b6b7ed4d7efe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/novedu/enterprise-admin-kit/git/commits/d45e67b2aa16095629f464450ed6b6ab3c8eeb0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59863927?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/novedu","id":59863927,"login":"novedu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODYzOTI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/novedu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/novedu/enterprise-admin-kit/commit/d45e67b2aa16095629f464450ed6b6ab3c8eeb0a","node_id":"C_kwDOTJcottoAKGQ0NWU2N2IyYWExNjA5NTYyOWY0NjQ0NTBlZDZiNmFiM2M4ZWViMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/novedu/enterprise-admin-kit/commit/95a6f3d3e9b7a0f9cec129a14f3e9c4764e635a2","sha":"95a6f3d3e9b7a0f9cec129a14f3e9c4764e635a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/novedu/enterprise-admin-kit/commits/95a6f3d3e9b7a0f9cec129a1