pi.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/28514e1dfc3284abb12d96788033546025009da7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:00:26Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:00:26Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(ux): status chips, hire confirmation, and real error states\n\nRemoves the \"app goes quiet at the moments that matter\" friction:\n\n- StatusChip component: raw DB status strings (\"ASSIGNED\", \"withdrawn\")\n  become colored, plain-English pills across My tasks, Find work, and task\n  detail (was uniform gray text).\n- Task detail hire flow: \"Select this provider\" → \"Hire this provider\" with a\n  confirmation dialog, surfaced errors (no more silent .catch), a busy state,\n  and a green \"✓ Hired\" / \"🎉 You were hired\" badge on the winning bid card.\n  Reloads the task so status + winner update in place.\n- Task detail now shows a real \"This task isn''t available\" state (with a way\n  back) instead of an eternal \"Loading…\" when a task is removed or the link\n  is dead.\n- Posted-task banner gets a one-tap Copy link button.\n- Owner zero-bid copy sets expectations (\"we''re notifying matching providers\")\n  instead of pointing at an empty space.\n- Tasks board shows a retryable error state instead of masking a failed fetch\n  as \"no jobs match\".\n- Additive API field selected_response_id on the task payload so the winning\n  bid can be badged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db309f26b3041c4b9a27785a81a14145a0e40a3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/db309f26b3041c4b9a27785a81a14145a0e40a3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/28514e1dfc3284abb12d96788033546025009da7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","