node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/2e3038ad1b2e3f70e52c8de2ef047a6025b10412/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T19:07:30Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T19:07:30Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(messages): full-screen chat layout with pinned header + composer\n\nRework the open-conversation view (/messages/:id) to behave like a real\nchat app instead of a fixed 70dvh box floating in the page:\n\n- Layout: the thread route now fills the viewport (h-[100dvh], page doesn''t\n  scroll, footer dropped). The app nav stays pinned on top; the thread owns\n  the space below it.\n- Messages: header is pinned to the top and shows the other party''s name\n  plus the job title, which now links out to its public post\n  (/tasks/:id or /resources/:id — both routes accept the subject id).\n- MessageThread: message list is the only thing that scrolls; the composer\n  is pinned to the bottom edge with safe-area padding so the mobile keyboard\n  and home indicator don''t cover it. Removed the inner card so it''s\n  edge-to-edge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc5a10ba46efa09c98b95ebc1e1a151215ca8049","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/fc5a10ba46efa09c98b95ebc1e1a151215ca8049"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/