\" section under every integration\ncard on /admin/integrations, with step-by-step instructions per integration\n(Google Sign-In, session key, Resend, Turnstile, OpenRouter). Replaces the terse\none-line \"Setup:\" note that only appeared when an integration was unconfigured;\nthe collapsible now shows for all integrations. Falls back to the server-provided\none-liner for any integration without hand-written steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4c023fb0f932e27f1c4c5f70ed281f94a8872d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/a4c023fb0f932e27f1c4c5f70ed281f94a8872d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/b81456a76630b0b00a1fcbc0c743932d4b22ec03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commit/b81456a76630b0b00a1fcbc0c743932d4b22ec03","node_id":"C_kwDOTJyKndoAKGI4MTQ1NmE3NjYzMGIwYjAwYTFmY2JjMGM3NDM5MzJkNGIyMmVjMDM","