ions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/13b13360cdd6fe15953e958dba1a2f15878fccce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T23:39:47Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T23:39:47Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(resources): AI auto-fill a listing from an equipment photo\n\nOn the Post Listing page, add an \"Auto-fill from a photo\" picker: upload a\npicture of the item and AI suggests the name, description, and daily rate; town\nand county come from the user''s own profile (a photo can''t reveal location). The\nanalyzed photo is also kept as a listing photo. A prominent \"AI can make\nmistakes — review before posting\" disclaimer sits on the widget.\n\n- lib/ai.ts: draftResourceFromImage() — OpenRouter vision (openai/gpt-4o-mini)\n  with a forced function-tool to return {title, description, daily_rate}.\n  Returns null when no key / on error.\n- routes/resources.ts: POST /api/resources/draft — session-gated, rate-limited,\n  magic-byte-validated image → base64 data URL → draft; 503 when AI unavailable.\n- Client compresses the photo first (reuses lib/image), so the request is small.\n\nUses the existing OPENROUTER_API_KEY secret.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"698ae06128f76b0fc2ff948df244e4af5097a1d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/698ae06128f76b0fc2ff948df244e4af5097a1d0"