ing\n\n- Post listing (PostResource): a required opt-in checkbox on create — the owner\n  agrees BidNeighbor is not responsible for any damage/injury/loss/dispute from\n  renting out their gear, and to the Liability Policy. Post button gated until\n  checked. Not shown on edit (already accepted).\n- Ask about this (ResourceDetail): a required rental agreement for a signed-in\n  non-owner — treat the equipment with respect, \"you break it you buy it\"\n  (responsible for repair/replacement), and BidNeighbor is not liable. \"Ask about\n  this\" gated until checked. Both link to /liability.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9970056321f4dbf4ad5553fc99bf0f50fc4347c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/c9970056321f4dbf4ad5553fc99bf0f50fc4347c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/3cca198d9f0b992b6cd31ece4c74241edfea16e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_ur