/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/1d481e76e49a4a2ff386db8bb0be131552b33319/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:33:18Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:33:18Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(resources): Neighborhood Resources UI (browse, detail, post, contact)\n\nFrontend for the Resources backend (#27).\n\n- Resources page (/resources): browse grid with cover photo, daily rate, town,\n  owner; search + county filter; empty-state pitch. Public.\n- ResourceDetail (/resources/:id): gallery, rate/deposit, description; \"Ask\n  about this\" opens a private thread (reuses the messaging engine); Report;\n  owner sees Edit/Remove.\n- PostResource (/resources/new + /:id/edit): title, description, daily rate,\n  deposit, town/county, photo upload. On a keyword-gate block the server''s\n  friendly reason shows inline.\n- Nav: Resources link in both lenses + a footer \"Rent equipment\" link for\n  logged-out discovery. api: Resource types + resourceFileUrl helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1a9eef215b81a7cdb6f7ba