4567323de37d","node_id":"C_kwDOTJyKndoAKDUyODllMmM1OTgxNmVkMGM5NjJjMzU4NjFkZjM0NTY3MzIzZGUzN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commit/656af6e81d21e29b28e4736bfa3446f8b73b26ce","sha":"656af6e81d21e29b28e4736bfa3446f8b73b26ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/656af6e81d21e29b28e4736bfa3446f8b73b26ce"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commit/6eab5b61a519f7a8a201e9d8fc066758d9c98e0b","sha":"6eab5b61a519f7a8a201e9d8fc066758d9c98e0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/6eab5b61a519f7a8a201e9d8fc066758d9c98e0b"}],"sha":"5289e2c59816ed0c962c35861df34567323de37d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/5289e2c59816ed0c962c35861df34567323de37d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/6eab5b61a519f7a8a201e9d8fc066758d9c98e0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:27:59Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:27:59Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(resources): Neighborhood Resources backend + content moderation\n\nResidents can list equipment with a daily rate; neighbors browse it. Every\nlisting passes a two-layer content filter.\n\n- 0010_resources.sql: resources + resource_files (reuses TASK_UPLOADS R2 under a\n  resources/ prefix and the admin_flags table — no new bindings).\n- lib/moderation.ts: fast synchronous keyword gate (slurs/explicit/spam),\n  word-boundary + leetspeak-folded so it doesn''t false-trigger on innocent\n  substrings. Blocks the worst on submit.\n- lib/ai.ts: async AI review via the Claude Messages API (raw fetch; strict\n  tool_use forces a JSON verdict). Model claude-haiku-4-5 (cheapest tier; swap\n  to claude-opus-4-8 for max accuracy). Fail-open + console fallback when\n  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is absent, like email.ts.\n- routes/resources.ts: browse/detail/create/edit/delete, photo upload+serve,\n  user report, and admin list/moderate. Create/edit run the keyword gate\n  synchronously and enqueue moderate_resource.\n- queue.ts: moderate_resource job — risky verdict flips status=''flagged'' +\n  admin_flags row; clear verdict sets moderation_state=''clear''. Off the request\n  path, so a slow/failed AI call never blocks a user.\n- Contact reuses the conversation engine: ''resource'' added to SUBJECT_TYPES and\n  resolveSubjectOwner, so \"Ask about this\" is one private thread, same as tasks.\n- Tests: keyword gate (blocks/passes/leetspeak/no-false-trigger/spam); subject\n  allowlist now includes ''resource''.\n\nNew secret (manual, one-time): wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5e5065aae9ebba0245a0a13bffc2e3663d85708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/c5e5065aae9ebba0245a0a13bffc2e3663d85708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/6eab5