0f9eed29f56aa1ead84a003e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:59:19Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:59:19Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(messaging): share images in private messages\n\nLet participants send images (with an optional caption) in a conversation.\n\n- 0009_message_files.sql: message_files table; conversation_id denormalized so\n  the serve endpoint authorizes a viewer without a join.\n- POST /api/conversations/:id/files — participant-only multipart upload; images\n  only, magic-byte checked, 10 MB cap, rate-limited. Creates a message + file,\n  bumps the thread, enqueues the same message_received notification.\n- GET /api/conversations/:cid/files/:fid — streams the attachment to\n  participants only (private cache; never shared). Reuses the TASK_UPLOADS\n  bucket under a messages/ prefix.\n- listMessages now returns per-message files (batched, no N+1).\n- MessageThread: 📷 picker in the composer; inline image bubbles linking to the\n  full image.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4439d482fe1953a1d4ac684006d6ac5075acc6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/d4439d482fe1953a1d4ac684006d6ac5075acc6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/d6e71a5efb078d70f9eed29f56aa1ead84a003e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-b