 (backend shipped in #22).\n\n- Messages page (/messages, /messages/:id): an inbox of threads with unread\n  badges + a two-party thread view. Only the other party''s name is shown.\n- MessageThread component: bubble list, gentle poll, Enter-to-send composer;\n  bodies render as text.\n- TaskDetail: owner gets a \"Message\" button per bid; a provider gets \"Message\n  the poster\" on their own bid. Both open (or reuse) the thread and jump to it.\n- Layout: a Messages nav link in both lenses with a live unread badge (30s poll).\n- Settings: a \"New private messages\" email toggle.\n- provider.updateProfile: whitelist notify_messages; api Me + helper types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e158489613f0225910848a4c350ec7630fe31669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/e158489613f0225910848a4c350ec7630fe31669"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/04dc5a6dc18662e4f6fad9b547d91bfb08db2ada","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https