96076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/c3da12410cfc5b7513492a8988aced3d5cbe32d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:33:18Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:33:18Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(messaging): private conversations between poster and one bidder\n\nAdd a generic two-party conversation engine so a task poster and a single\nresponder can talk privately to clarify a job — invisible to every other\nbidder. Threads hang off a subject (task now, resource later) so the Resources\nsprint reuses this unchanged.\n\n- 0008_conversations.sql: conversations, messages, conversation_reads;\n  notify_messages opt-out on users. Unique (subject_type, subject_id,\n  initiator_id) makes opening a thread idempotent; reads are index-served.\n- lib/conversations.ts: pure isParticipant / recipientOf authz + subject\n  allowlist, plus findOrCreate / read-state helpers behind one owner-resolution\n  choke point.\n- routes/conversations.ts: inbox, find-or-create, thread read (marks read),\n  post (sanitized, rate-limited, enqueues notify), mark-read. Every endpoint\n  gated by isParticipant; non-participants get 403. Task threads require a prior\n  response so a poster''s inbox stays real bidders.\n- queue.ts: message_received emails the other party (respects notify_messages);\n  the message body is never put in the email.\n- Tests: participant authz, recipient routing, subject allowlist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf15a86cdd312d3459c7941e0718254b78d45d8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/bf15a86cdd312d3459c7941e0718254b78d45d8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/c3da12410cfc5b7513492a8988aced3d5cbe32d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commit/c3da12410cfc5b7513492a8988aced3d5cbe32d8","node_id":"C_kwDOTJyKndoAKGMzZGExMjQxMGNmYzViNzUxMzQ5MmE4OTg4YWNlZDNkNWNiZTMyZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commit/f220aff53c706904519aaed06217f1a13fede574","sha":"f220aff53c706904519aaed06217f1a13fede574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/f220aff53c706904519aaed06217f1a13fede574"}],"sha":"c3da12410cfc5b7513492a8988aced3d5cbe32d8","url":"http