ts/04a251bf9a4e1fe737eb580b9336e3ed555685b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T00:43:23Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T00:43:23Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"fix(ux): make address Save button responsive; surface autofill failures\n\nThe \"Save address\" button silently did nothing after selecting an\nautocomplete suggestion in two cases:\n\n1. Picking a suggestion fills the search box immediately, but the\n   structured street/city/state/zip fields only populate after a second\n   Place Details fetch. That fetch''s failure was swallowed, so the box\n   looked filled while the real fields stayed empty.\n2. Save was `disabled` whenever any of those four fields was blank — a\n   dead grey button with no feedback, which reads as \"not working.\"\n\n- AddressAutocomplete: surface a Details-fetch failure (\"Couldn''t load\n  that address automatically — please enter it in the fields below\")\n  instead of swallowing it.\n- AddressOnboarding: keep Save enabled (disabled only while saving) and\n  validate on submit with a clear message naming the missing fields.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1e514f4097a7e7c5e993f714abf0d76a1539b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/f1e514f4097a7e7c5e993f714abf0d76a1539b67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/04a251bf9a4e1fe737eb580b9336e3ed555685b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github