7096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/0eb5dde94b1df6cec26015972590d7b305e6a4f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T23:37:42Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T23:37:42Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat(ui): dual-mode ''Get help'' / ''Do jobs'' lens with one-tap switch\n\nThe app now serves its two audiences distinctly. A persistent header switch\nflips between the ''Get help'' (post tasks) and ''Do jobs'' (provider) lenses,\nrewriting the nav, home, and primary action. Mode is a UI lens only — all\nauthorization stays server-side.\n\n- ModeProvider/useMode: localStorage + per-user last_mode (mirrors ThemeProvider)\n- ModeSwitch: segmented control in the header (desktop) and its own row (mobile)\n- Home: logged-out split hero (both intents); signed-in renders the neighbor\n  home or the provider dashboard by mode\n- ProviderSetup: first switch to ''Do jobs'' runs a quick county+categories setup\n  so the dashboard is never an empty dead-end\n- TaskDetail: owner controls vs respond form keyed off is_owner + mode, replacing\n  the fragile response-count heuristic; ''Get help'' shows a switch-to-respond nudge\n- MyTasks: read /api/my-tasks (own tasks, any status)\n- Settings: notification toggles grouped by ''getting help'' / ''doing jobs''\n- relabel provider copy to ''Find work'' / ''My bids''\n- tests for providerSetupComplete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa4c573c6cc77d860dad7d638a84e20ea0c39955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/aa4c573c6cc77d860dad7d638a84e20ea0c39955"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/0eb5dde94b1df6cec26015972590d7b305e6a4f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commit/0eb5dde94b1df6cec26015972590d7b305e6a4f3","node_id":"C_kwDOTJyKndoAKDBlYjVkZGU5NGIxZGY2Y2VjMjYwMTU5NzI1OTBkN2IzMDVlNmE0ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"h