//api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commits/ed097545ee21df6d750186827ed4da4512332577/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T23:01:41Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T23:01:41Z","email":"seo-byte@users.noreply.github.com","name":"seo-byte"},"message":"feat: address autocomplete + post-signup address onboarding\n\nCollect a user''s address after signup with Google Places autofill.\n\n- New migration 0006: users.latitude / users.longitude (geocoded coords;\n  NULL on manual entry; enables future distance matching).\n- Worker proxy /api/places/autocomplete + /api/places/details (Places API\n  New) keeps GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY server-side, requires a session, and is\n  KV rate-limited per user. Pure parsers in lib/places.ts (unit tested).\n- PATCH /api/me accepts numeric latitude/longitude (only finite values\n  written, so manual edits never clobber existing coords).\n- Frontend: AddressAutocomplete component (debounced, session-token billing),\n  dismissible AddressOnboarding prompt shown to any signed-in user missing a\n  street address, and ProviderProfile retrofit to use the same autocomplete.\n- Docs: SPEC env section + CLAUDE.md worktree guidance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"313177c9e4d41e7d2da6a2538f53f6d11d9f0d8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/313177c9e4d41e7d2da6a2538f53f6d11d9f0d8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/ed097545ee21df6d750186827ed4da4512332577","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/fol