outes:Edit, so wrangler\ncan''t reconcile [[routes]] — every deploy failed at the route-attach step (worker\nstill uploaded, but the job reported failure). Routing is now handled by a manual\ndashboard route ''*.bidneighbor.com/*'' -> bidneighbor, which covers app. + admin.\n(the Worker routes by Host). Documented how to restore IaC routes if the token\nlater gains the zone permission.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8ee2025796d60ec8f7fbcbe6394651967a04e19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/trees/c8ee2025796d60ec8f7fbcbe6394651967a04e19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kroelofs/bidneighbor/git/commits/013e5907d4de2a05423d1b144f6632b137680850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277096076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/seo-byte","id":277096076,"login":"seo-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEIQmjA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seo-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kroelofs/bidneighbor/commit/013e5907d4de2a05423d1b144f6632b137680850","node_id":"C_kwDOTJyKndoAKDAxM2U1OTA3ZDRkZTJhMDU0MjNkMWIxNDRmNjYzMmIxMzc2ODA4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https:/