nvariants, drawing the\nsmallest aggregate boundary (root/members vs cross-aggregate references),\nsmall aggregates + reference-by-id, and read surfaces over the core model.\nMapped onto devedge''s native infoblox.ddd.v1 aggregate/member/references,\nAggregateRepository Load/Save, the root Validate(ctx) invariant hook, the\nfail-closed AssertAggregateBoundaries gate, storage.v1.model multi-surface,\nand eventual cross-aggregate consistency via the outbox. Grounded in\nconcepts/aggregates.md + the ddd/field/storage proto + testdata/iam.\n\nMarketplace -> 0.3.0. Composes with publish-api; distinct from new-service.","tree":{"sha":"18d1f849aad83990b120713a5d463db5cb8d5475","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/git/trees/18d1f849aad83990b120713a5d463db5cb8d5475"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/git/commits/c5bff354483e43c8f3d0345f48f6ee13cad897c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 18d1f849aad83990b120713a5d463db5cb8d5475\nparent dd225b9b7f68a9488243654fe2664cfcd8a0cebc\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782955143 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782955143 -0500\n\nAdd model-domain skill: DDD aggregates + core-model-vs-surfaces (#3)\n\nA domain-modeling skill spined on core-model-vs-surfaces with full DDD\nreasoning — entities vs value objects, finding invariants, drawing the\nsmallest aggregate boundary (root/members vs cross-aggregate references),\nsmall aggregates + reference-by-id, and read surfaces over the core model.\nMapped onto devedge''s native infoblox.ddd.v1 aggregate/member/references,\nAggregateRepository Load/Save, the root Validate(ctx) invariant hook, the\nfail-closed AssertAggregateBoundaries gate, storage.v1.model multi-surface,\nand eventual cross-aggregate consistency via the outbox. Grounded in\nconcepts/aggregates.md + the ddd/field/storage proto + testdata/iam.\n\nMarketplace -> 0.3.0. Composes with publish-api; distinct from new-service.","reason":"val