hmM2QwMzQ1ZjQ4ZjZlZTEzY2FkODk3YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/commit/dd225b9b7f68a9488243654fe2664cfcd8a0cebc","sha":"dd225b9b7f68a9488243654fe2664cfcd8a0cebc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/commits/dd225b9b7f68a9488243654fe2664cfcd8a0cebc"}],"sha":"c5bff354483e43c8f3d0345f48f6ee13cad897c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/commits/c5bff354483e43c8f3d0345f48f6ee13cad897c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/commits/dd225b9b7f68a9488243654fe2664cfcd8a0cebc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T00:56:14Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T00:56:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add four common-operation skills: publish-api, run-locally, new-ufe, compose-services (#2)\n\nGrow the devedge marketplace from bootstrap-only to the common devedge operations.\nEach new plugin is a single skill matching the new-service shape (trigger-focused\ndescription, \"where the truth lives\" grounding on hosted docs + de/apx --help,\nnumbered workflow, verified gotchas, guardrails):\n\n- publish-api      publish a service''s API as OpenAPI through apx + generate/consume\n                   a typed TS client; local + unreleased-API hot-loops.\n- run-locally      bring a service up on the local dev edge (*.dev.test), round-trip\n                   it, and diagnose daemon/route/trust failures.\n- new-ufe          scaffold an Angular + single-spa micro-frontend wired to the\n                   devedge-ufe SDK and a kind:Shell roster.\n- compose-services compose service modules into one host process (suite binary).\n\nBumps the marketplace to 0.2.0; new-service unchanged at 0.1.2. All flags/commands\ngrounded in de/apx --help; only the published doc-site URLs are referenced.","tree":{"sha":"2305ec8da70db4e90c171465f3ff3ab5f4f58d0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/git/trees/2305ec8da70db4e90c171465f3ff3ab5f4f58d0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-claude-plugins/git/commits/dd225b9b7f68a9488243654fe2664cfcd8a0cebc","verification":{"payload":"tree 2305ec8da70db4e90c171465f3ff3ab5f4f58d0d\nparent 145421c299662dab95f2636add9dfaffe9230f19\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782953774 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782953774 -0500\n\nAdd four common-operation skills: publish-api, run-locally, new-ufe, compose-services (#2)\n\nGrow the devedge marketplace from bootstrap-only to the common devedge operations.\nEach new plugin is a single skill matching the new-service shape (trigger-focused\ndescription, \"where the truth lives\" grounding on hosted docs + de/apx --help,\nnumbered workflow, verified gotchas, guardrails):\n\n- publish-api      publish a service''s API as OpenAPI through apx + generate/consume\n                   a typed TS client; local + unreleased-API hot-loops.\n- run-locally      bring a service up on the local dev edge (*.dev.test), round-trip\n                   it, and diagnose daemon/route/trust failures.\n- new-ufe          scaffold an Angular + single-spa micro-frontend wired to the\n                   devedge-ufe SDK and a kind:Shell roster.\n- compose-services compose service modules into one host process (suite binary).\n\nBumps the marketplace to 0.2.0; new-service unchanged at 0.1.2. All flags/commands\ngrounded in de/apx --help; only the published doc-site URLs are referenced.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRbcvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIpQQAI/AkUtl2BQ3mWEYvjOOGHgl\nTi9c2xuUbScE/m7fHV4WpU3Yjp/R5USqVjx5DdlU8cExNMmel4ms0SquXJOYarW4\n/hgSBa40mcfTKSTEegZfZvEIvxXoCFXsCL7s2AyNtJP3mCSA4tCDte+A598zPlqE\njPvFvMp7mZyqCaxY32nlLvrS9DaYPm6oJVNnRLlgrUtiWMFoH9G/1HIVx2ftdJKF\nvjrDx6pI21VFNivutD0T6YvMWKda1qONSc2skUo8AIKNmLS259f++MQj37xbX66b\nEmtvbqwcOFXcKdgt3ErCm/PVXGG1f/WvAaibE17bu70aVJDP6O+pp5Ox/Fw+9rwD\nlPVYThrajE43E+4+vddLtqXRjcoiiWgzUwtEDDh+l8Mkh/+b6y7eB1P7dPX7HvtQ\naiWif346gqMjq1hF03dwkWg/vOq/77khZ0QFM1ogk62xft1L+tahYhc5YVR0pvum\n6CRlJmh0DX31Liu39xmM2iaSJVutxLNhX+2TffRzeRF6O9xZaM38PFKSJ//0XVRu\n0hLtvHgAxZvJ/R5RT7zXaG6HzfswNH5i2Lm3LESLFcBy5hvO3zEVU2WdXeYL1xF6\nvtleKSMGt/d4Jeoci3rcSnc5Fwv+ByHuqHNmnUtX6trnNiyzRjUHX1zKA9etrLto\nNQ3zv4+Vj5NCH2SSbeU6\n=dPiF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T00:56:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0ND