thor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/9964edd2d0bc1515d6e8faaa5f84d6c28a1849bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:21:39Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:23:46Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"message":"feat(share): fix manifest->chunk waterfall with preloading and resource hints\n\nMounting a remote component was a strict two-hop sequential fetch: manifest,\nthen (only once resolved) the chunk. Three additions shrink or eliminate\nthat waterfall from the critical path:\n\n- preloadRemoteComponent(manifestUrl, exposeName, options?): warms both the\n  manifest and chunk caches ahead of an actual mount, and injects a deduped\n  <link rel=\"modulepreload\"> for the resolved chunk URL. Accepts\n  fetchPriority to mark speculative preloads as low-priority.\n- RemoteManifestPreloadLink: a <link rel=\"preload\" as=\"fetch\"> for the\n  manifest, meant for a server-rendered layout so the browser''s preload\n  scanner fetches it during HTML parsing, before any React code runs.\n- registry.preload(exposeName): same preload, manifest URL already bound.\n\nBoth preloadRemoteComponent and the above respect the user''s connection by\ndefault (respectConnection: true): on Save-Data or a slow connection the\npreload resolves immediately without fetching anything, so a speculative\nhover-triggered preload doesn''t compete with the actual critical path. This\nnever affects useRemoteComponent/<RemoteComponent> themselves, which always\nload when they genuinely need to mount.\n\nAlso extracts resolveExposeChunkUrl, deduping logic that was previously\ninline-duplicated in useRemoteComponent, and updates the root README to\ndocument this session''s additions across lazy-handler and share.","tree":{"sha":"998fa1348c99b043c8be96f45245f1139ffe8c31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/trees/998fa1348c99b043c8be96f45245f1139ffe8c31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/commits/9964edd2d0bc1515d6e8faaa5f84d6c28a1849bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/9964edd2d0bc1515d6e8faaa5f84d6c28a1849bf","node_id":"C_kwDOTJ9m-NoAKDk5NjRlZGQyZDBiYzE1MTVkNmU4ZmFhYTVmODRkNmMyOGExODQ5YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b","sha":"afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b"}],"sha":"9964edd2d0bc1515d6e8faaa5f84d6c28a1849bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/9964edd2d0bc1515d6e8faaa5f84d6c28a1849bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:20:58Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:23:45Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"message":"feat(lazy-handler): add respectConnection to skip preloadOn on slow connections\n\nAdds respectConnection (default true) to useLazyHandler/useLazyForm/\n<Interactive>: on Save-Data or a slow (2g/slow-2g) connection, speculative\npreloadOn strategies (hover/focus/idle/visible) are skipped so they don''t\ncompete with whatever''s actually on the critical path. The real trigger\nevent is never skipped -- only the early, speculative fetch. Relies on the\nnon-standard, Chromium-only Network Information API; a no-op (never skips)\nin Firefox/Safari.\n\nAlso documents why the library can''t emit real browser resource hints\n(<link rel=\"modulepreload\">) for handler modules -- loader is a\nbundler-resolved import() whose build-time URL the library never sees --\nand the webpackPrefetch/webpackPreload magic-comment alternative.","tree":{"sha":"2f854c4375d15cd47ec37241d82f216e1e2b060d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/trees/2f854c4375d15cd47ec37241d82f216e1e2b060d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/commits/afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b","node_id":"C_kwDOTJ9m-NoAKGFmYjBiOGRkMzExNjA1YjQyMDg4YjlhZGFkZDU5NWM0MTFmOTRjMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a","sha":"e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a"}],"sha":"afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/afb0b8dd311605b42088b9adadd595c411f94c2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T23:56:22Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:23:45Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"message":"feat(share): add createRemoteRegistry to bind a manifest URL once\n\nBinds a manifest URL (and default UseRemoteComponentOptions) once, so call\nsites reference exposes by name instead of repeating the manifest URL\nstring everywhere -- useful once an app consumes several exposes from the\nsame host. Also exports RemoteComponentProps for consumers building their\nown wrappers.\n\nAlso updates the root README to document this session''s additions across\nall three packages: hydration''s strategy arrays/interactionEvents/\nerrorFallback, and lazy-handler''s useLazyForm/error surfacing.","tree":{"sha":"bf07c0cd83b744dfab5427fd68ed082f0ae2730f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/trees/bf07c0cd83b744dfab5427fd68ed082f0ae2730f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/commits/e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a","node_id":"C_kwDOTJ9m-NoAKGUyNGJmMDI4ODliOWVhMmE4Yjc2NWM1NzcyZGFmNDZhZmE4Yzk5M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d","sha":"29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d"}],"sha":"e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/e24bf02889b9ea2a8b765c5772daf46afa8c993a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T23:56:00Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:23:44Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"message":"feat(lazy-handler): add useLazyForm, preventDefault option, error/onError surfacing\n\n- add preventDefault option to useLazyHandler: calls event.preventDefault()\n  synchronously on interception, before the handler module loads.\n- add useLazyForm, a useLazyHandler preset for the submit-handler case. A\n  bare event: ''submit'' handler is unsafe on its own: the browser''s native\n  submit navigates away before an async import() can resolve. useLazyForm\n  always prevents default so this can''t happen.\n- useLazyHandler now returns error in its tuple and accepts onError; a\n  failed dynamic import was previously swallowed silently with no way to\n  surface it to the UI.\n- wire error surfacing through <Interactive> (errorFallback, onError props)\n  and withLazyHandlers (injects an error prop alongside isLoading).","tree":{"sha":"ebf25dfbc563ce4f4adbb63d30309c35fabd70bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/trees/ebf25dfbc563ce4f4adbb63d30309c35fabd70bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/commits/29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d","node_id":"C_kwDOTJ9m-NoAKDI5YTgwMTljMGFlYzQ5NTkwNDUwZWFmN2FjMzhjNzE1ZDRhNTMwMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba","sha":"dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba"}],"sha":"29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/29a8019c0aec49590450eaf7ac38c715d4a5300d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T23:55:14Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:23:44Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"message":"feat(hydration): support strategy arrays, narrow interaction events, add errorFallback\n\n- strategy now accepts an array (e.g. [''visible'', ''idle'']) so a boundary can\n  hydrate on whichever strategy fires first, without nesting boundaries.\n- add interactionEvents to narrow the ''interaction'' strategy beyond the\n  default pointerenter/focusin/touchstart, e.g. interactionEvents={[''click'']}.\n- add errorFallback, backed by an internal HydrationErrorBoundary, so a\n  rejected loader renders a fallback instead of requiring the caller to\n  supply their own error boundary.\n- fix test pollution: the requestIdleCallback-absent test was restoring the\n  property to undefined instead of deleting it, corrupting later tests''\n  ''requestIdleCallback'' in window checks.","tree":{"sha":"6b4a12e968b0daf154f663cd5a47756172f536bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/trees/6b4a12e968b0daf154f663cd5a47756172f536bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/commits/dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba","node_id":"C_kwDOTJ9m-NoAKGRkMDZhMzI4YzJhY2FmZGNiZjkzZDIyZjM2NzFkMGRiN2E1YWM1YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/52cf47975043daa8d15f6ef2b8ecea03ae97a48c","sha":"52cf47975043daa8d15f6ef2b8ecea03ae97a48c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/52cf47975043daa8d15f6ef2b8ecea03ae97a48c"}],"sha":"dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/dd06a328c2acafdcbf93d22f3671d0db7a5ac5ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semantic-release-bot","id":32174276,"login":"semantic-release-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc0Mjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/52cf47975043daa8d15f6ef2b8ecea03ae97a48c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:51:15Z","email":"semantic-release-bot@martynus.net","name":"semantic-release-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:51:15Z","email":"semantic-release-bot@martynus.net","name":"semantic-release-bot"},"message":"chore(release): @chetand/share 2.0.0 [skip ci]\n\n## [@chetand/share-v2.0.0](https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/compare/@chetand/share-v1.0.0...@chetand/share-v2.0.0) (2026-07-06)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **share:** assertSharedDepsAvailable''s runtime version check no longer\ntreats a bare (non-caret) entry.version as an exact-match requirement; it now\nalways applies caret-range semantics, so a live shared dependency with a\nhigher patch than declared is accepted instead of throwing.\n\n### Features\n\n* **share:** add hot-reload, patch-depth checks, generic peer-libs; hydration gets code-splitting ([5df8e3b](https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/5df8e3b83dbbcf03f960bff96b6dcb215becbea3))","tree":{"sha":"10405fb3b1f3cf007c3456236226a4d181b32836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/trees/10405fb3b1f3cf007c3456236226a4d181b32836"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/commits/52cf47975043daa8d15f6ef2b8ecea03ae97a48c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semantic-release-bot","id":32174276,"login":"semantic-release-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc0Mjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.githu