om/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commits/5df8e3b83dbbcf03f960bff96b6dcb215becbea3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:48:51Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:49:45Z","email":"chetandasauni25@gmail.com","name":"chetan"},"message":"feat(share)!: add hot-reload, patch-depth checks, generic peer-libs; hydration gets code-splitting\n\nCombines the four remaining items from the Known Limitations list:\n\n- hydration: HydrationBoundary gains a loader prop (mutually exclusive with\n  children) that dynamically imports the wrapped component only once the\n  hydration strategy fires, closing the \"no code-splitting integration\" gap.\n- share: hot-reload for remote chunks via a new watchChunkForChanges poller\n  that hashes the chunk body to detect a host rebuild and cache-busts the\n  reload, since chunk filenames are stable and browsers cache import() by URL\n  forever.\n- share: shared-dep version comparison now checks the full major.minor.patch\n  triple (satisfiesCaretRange) instead of ignoring patch, and the runtime\n  guard always applies caret-range semantics instead of accidentally\n  requiring an exact match depending on the host''s package.json prefix.\n- share: generic peer-library sharing beyond React/React-DOM via\n  BridgeSharedDepsProvider''s new shared prop and generateSharedDepShim, which\n  introspects a real library''s exports at build time to generate a matching\n  shim — demonstrated end-to-end with date-fns shared between apps/host and\n  apps/web.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: assertSharedDepsAvailable''s runtime version check no longer\ntreats a bare (non-caret) entry.version as an exact-match requirement; it now\nalways applies caret-range semantics, so a live shared dependency with a\nhigher patch than declared is accepted instead of throwing.","tree":{"sha":"40c35e91570bff888a9bbcbcb263f6c1e8dac92e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/trees/40c35e91570bff888a9bbcbcb263f6c1e8dac92e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/git/commits/5df8e3b83dbbcf03f960bff96b6dcb215becbea3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8482179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25","id":8482179,"login":"chetan25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0ODIxNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chetan25","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/5df8e3b83dbbcf03f960bff96b6dcb215becbea3","node_id":"C_kwDOTJ9m-NoAKDVkZjhlM2I4M2RiYmNmMDNmOTYwYmZmOTZiNmRjYjIxNWJlY2JlYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chetan25/nextjs-bridges/commit/0dbb72e015d36dbfa9ad5c4609357228ce5500f9","sha":"0dbb72e015d36dbfa9ad5c4609357228