_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/commits/66c4e554f81f36973cd8604fc50f07dd05cd9a77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:23:02Z","email":"mtlewis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"MT Lewis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T23:23:56Z","email":"mtlewis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"MT Lewis"},"message":"fix(ui): dynamically resize tab indicator when tab content changes width\n\nObserve all tab elements with a single ResizeObserver so the indicator\nrepositions when a tab''s content changes size without a window resize,\ncoalescing updates to one per frame. A MutationObserver on the tabs\ncontainer keeps the observed set in sync when tab elements are added,\nremoved, or replaced. Resize-driven repositions skip the indicator\ntransition so it tracks the tab instantly instead of lagging behind.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: MT Lewis <mtlewis@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d9064fc5305ba9c248ead0a3851a86f0a04d8cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/git/trees/9d9064fc5305ba9c248ead0a3851a86f0a04d8cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/git/commits/66c4e554f81f36973cd8604fc50f07dd05cd9a77","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d9064fc5305ba9c248ead0a3851a86f0a04d8cc\nparent 73d8ac07b9ab9989057655b937fe63c7d88cc491\nauthor MT Lewis <mtlewis@users.noreply.github.com> 1781216582 +0100\ncommitter MT Lewis <mtlewis@users.noreply.github.com> 1781306636 +0100\n\nfix(ui): dynamically resize tab indicator when tab content changes width\n\nObserve all tab elements with a single ResizeObserver so the indicator\nrepositions when a tab''s content changes size without a window resize,\ncoalescing updates to one per frame. A MutationObserver on the tabs\ncontainer keeps the observed set in sync when tab elements are added,\nremoved, or replaced. Resize-driven repositions skip the indicator\ntransition so it tracks the tab instantly instead of lagging behind.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: MT Lewis <mtlewis@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEVdH/Nzaih/Sse2L1N1nMx3ivVYcFAmoslTUbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEDdZzMd4r1WHH+YP/1qMmvetdPhGqHE6I2pc\nucaqTqob9uClQtF3jp1uM50N3pk9i3GTRwYm7WlIAlpxWmb0kqpYiQziVR77MmXG\nWXCFSgdCxVuSwi23dvpsheIBwI27DsBLtO3Na2Ijq4ya5ZDyvFioEX2wwUa9Txxi\nPl7o9ImjWqKuWGGFAzJgS0tsUmh7lmpQ1jWoEkvwc9o5LnfRIlV+cHrcJaFjrgJ3\nhPEdfsFhM5A7iSGsnb801vaim9Ijs6eI28UIyUnaboygEV1Hvjkgv/eHJ/cBJ8Cl\nkorL4M4Kzw4ibuLKOmYxYEuwCcwHw4MdU8gKOPuZmM8X94rl3pRZsQTQ400waP5v\nU6hMP+mn7DVdOwZRGf/30CY4fInv0CTkr/G0ZvogjPNgz6izORg3pqHdxFwhHIHH\nKylWsUJRRRIK6DYoWUe4I8//haoas0dtrDqkV8GPuwydrpURiqvmZ6OXQy4EY07A\n5KzRTqZt+Nl8OI7EizsOtddsyRYc7crbYTypOITFBmzljUG9TIQkCKeJ08Vhp34Q\nF8cMERMccYcLeL9ETMh6ir6AkmSvA/4UphfNebj6tpXqgTAki0huAUQCdL2zgWGe\nWHsLLfM9kn2NIyHADBT+mWD/8ZfoPkOngvCrHLXWUiJLRlCaQXgO0aTu2BYUMRFv\nvsD4O0REyW98y3vRaHSRusde\n=z81Q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-01T03:59:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/542836?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mtlewis","id":542836,"login":"mtlewis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjgzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtlewis/receiv