-qualified command name to cleye as its `name` option and\nlet cleye generate the help/usage line, instead of manually assembling\nthe usage string and appending positional arguments. This relies on\ncleye 2.4.0+ supporting spaces in the CLI name. As a result the usage\nline now consistently lists the available flags and positional\narguments, including for commands that previously omitted them.\n\nSigned-off-by: Patrik Oldsberg <poldsberg@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ad34dc95f3b4c6ea340c6175984a1128f17aa90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/git/trees/2ad34dc95f3b4c6ea340c6175984a1128f17aa90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/git/commits/696c78c33e62f324d82c3837558fcb47a9207e4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4984472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rugvip","id":4984472,"login":"Rugvip","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODQ0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/commit/696c78c33e62f324d82c3837558fcb47a9207e4b","node_id":"C_kwDOTKIEjtoAKDY5NmM3OGMzM2U2MmYzMjR