.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/commits/89a95ca436b8c8fa0ccd9f02a416237a872c8a4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T10:26:36Z","email":"poldsberg@gmail.com","name":"Patrik Oldsberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T10:26:36Z","email":"poldsberg@gmail.com","name":"Patrik Oldsberg"},"message":"Fix task worker retry loop to respect abort signal\n\nThe retry loop in both TaskWorker and LocalTaskWorker would continue\nretrying indefinitely even after the abort signal was triggered,\nbecause the catch block neither checked the signal nor passed it to\nthe sleep call. This caused workers to never shut down gracefully\nwhen encountering repeated errors after being signaled to stop.\n\nCheck the abort signal at the top of the catch block and pass it\nthrough to the retry delay sleep call.\n\nSigned-off-by: Patrik Oldsberg <poldsberg@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdd541db154f42e6fe0119a6d9f3acc852235672","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/git/trees/bdd541db154f42e6fe0119a6d9f3acc852235672"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SerenityInAllThings/Backstage_test/git/commits/89a95ca436b8c8fa0ccd9f02a416237a872c8a4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4984472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rugvip","id":4984472,"login":"Rugvip","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODQ0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rugvip/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.