users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/commits/953299afab10c32c084df377ce5efbdb07a960da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T20:31:50Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T20:31:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(angular): add dev-only devAuthInterceptor for local dev round-trips (#23)\n\nA devedge-sdk dev authorizer reads raw account-id/groups metadata, not a bearer\ntoken, so the bearer interceptor alone gets PermissionDenied in local dev. Add\nDEV_AUTH_HEADERS + provideDevAuthHeaders + devAuthInterceptor, which stamps the\nconfigured identity headers on allowed API origins (the same origin gate the\nbearer interceptor uses) and is a no-op when the token is empty (production).\nMirrors the CLI --header / Terraform headers dev seam.","tree":{"sha":"1f1a996937be8635c5965bde0ee6d0d8ddd37532","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/trees/1f1a996937be8635c5965bde0ee6d0d8ddd37532"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/commits/953299afab10c32c084df377ce5efbdb07a960da","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f1a996937be8635c5965bde0ee6d0d8ddd37532\nparent fa30177809c7a08eefa399b6f742ccf53149e503\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783110710 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783110710 -0500\n\nfeat(angular): add dev-only devAuthInterceptor for local dev round-trips (#23)\n\nA devedge-sdk dev authorizer reads raw account-id/groups metadata, not a bearer\ntoken, so the bearer interceptor alone gets PermissionDenied in local dev. Add\nDEV_AUTH_HEADERS + provideDevAuthHeaders + devAuthInterceptor, which stamps the\nconfigured identity headers on allowed API origins (the same origin gate the\nbearer interceptor uses) and is a no-op when the token is empty (production).\nMirrors the CLI --header / Terraform headers dev seam.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSBw2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/+oQAEGAc2pB369YHUcnOl0WY8on\npISjZhH924w4XDe74NevmbNXI/p07jnJEh7+f2HhoQwtXq7CInf3hIKWwbf/+ZLL\nfL16sdbYVhEexotdLdewNWor712i6r8jInwvxJYqw3xt3SfYN63LAS4cqUG32cpY\nBjpbJlHNbLybbJj5aaMpX+ZoKaa0cx30m6vkjoR+vzdH5JRXJaSpiwU3lm7xdJcr\nbz2BSU4SiNAT++VflxVyuv+ieJNoTVz6NzTvkqMnREw4zjgDoT0i+l+bg9roXi99\nrOvwPfUFU/cfm2e7jWi4BFIKeSsNGfAf4xWcBv/BwHFEH4+6MBN4W9kgsc5tzz0P\nrP4WK+NAc9vVg6icrPVmW5krMq2uEskEH/94xvnrtHgfpcE6pQCr1uV+jz8lfiR/\n53HEIJilFfe7nKTWCRi1MncsyFZY/4n7MG1QcczwzbagJgH8tf9n6h6D8hzgWe8R\nCyKW346x4l7AfE1Gftu8o+606UNWxFJaYUdUZsZmxyVdpdhtmz7voiNfRQuNCJff\nq7F0MUr4jL7j2UYl/tzPItOdQs1sX5twb2x6HV/T7Ycdevt08V+wkvaYRlgv3iYk\nHhDR9kwGNfhm1Wa1vxZjPIrdcVf8SLh5a3lJweG26rc9i3aFqVYm4F6DnOYe5wB/\nfII4pIkHc1iUZFQ0Ukl1\n=Tiv/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T20:31:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":