m/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/commits/f6e34d6c4e5561b6e4f84453d701131c3b2bc0d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T23:56:26Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T23:56:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"example(fullstack-oss): consume an apx-generated typed API client (#9)\n\nReplace the hand-written notes.service.ts + hand-written types with the client\ngenerated by `apx client generate` (@example/notesd-client, committed source).\nThe service delegates to the generated per-operation functions and models; the\nbase URL is wired with the generated provideApiConfiguration(rootUrl) helper, and\nthe bearer interceptor still applies because the ops use the app''s HttpClient.\nDocument the local hot loop (proto -> client -> uFE, no publish). dist/ stays a\ngit-ignored build artifact built from the committed source.","tree":{"sha":"ae42b677365adc4a0d1732d9e4cc28ae8fe0108c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/trees/ae42b677365adc4a0d1732d9e4cc28ae8fe0108c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/commits/f6e34d6c4e5561b6e4f84453d701131c3b2bc0d0","verification":{"payload":"tree ae42b677365adc4a0d1732d9e4cc28ae8fe0108c\nparent cce96c38d8c3b6147ea0033ea8afba419aec3d02\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782950186 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782950186 -0500\n\nexample(fullstack-oss): consume an apx-generated typed API client (#9)\n\nReplace the hand-written notes.service.ts + hand-written types with the client\ngenerated by `apx client generate` (@example/notesd-client, committed source).\nThe service delegates to the generated per-operation functions and models; the\nbase URL is wired with the generated provideApiConfiguration(rootUrl) helper, and\nthe bearer interceptor still applies because the ops use the app''s HttpClient.\nDocument the local hot loop (proto -> client -> uFE, no publish). dist/ stays a\ngit-ignored build artifact built from the committed source.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRakqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5HcQAI1DiNlWtTp4lndEeAYZRnSf\nuircUDxSJIwxjih4UUrq9HpGvJwWEtmgC9e+NSQzoKtUn6+tdhgeSvnTctEgUfps\nevrdR66O3JKjJfAuG/UlbGp/iAL6PDYgEDYv++FAVcnQUTfzicdAjO3BKE3bCqX1\nxs63kEV0Y9mSvRF8AAvc6+arZVi9mwMgl8TiOc/MnpGyCR7SZF3AFRpFOPUBsmbn\nqlyQB9mHIX+DQh89LkKvs+BJ3HQL8M09RpKKgHdpkvfBuBOiRxhe3c5+3JPUOy7W\niKDYRlmmE20451UeMqrSx6C/e0TuAagxu01nUdbn25QFVE7ZIj4PsGRaS34mwT7r\nq+iy/hvRW8/rqntEWUfNPm4cqbTgd8DIuz3gfBePIw1iCWem2gplSCHBmN/m19pp\nGzgfUmWWbY4ybfj2P8Sqnf8c/Zqhipo8diNIuC6C+ZU326plilwlea93aV8g4Tcq\nkpP3GvXX+tx0pFutXCWgZo1zHTNRWkrKUTDFTdH2oC/W0E9vGxJcldpD0wEyHBDe\nvuLQE4/ZmArg3Xe7txOkCn+umTOLWMyaMQYGalGSCzUxJ2J3+yqcDqnrOBFQnX+W\nv95ZhcZGTq+perqgJQAcwc7FSdcgv11JXY7alVIsKtSET2Y/Zt+30fw2POLmbaig\nvRinHGSLl7r7HNyDHENf\n=u9ZF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-01T23:56:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","follow