aniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/commits/cce96c38d8c3b6147ea0033ea8afba419aec3d02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:38:34Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:38:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: ship devedge-ufe-sdk site, reconciled to the shipped shell (#8)\n\nAdd the Hugo/Hextra documentation site for devedge-ufe-sdk (WS-018 Phase E,\ncloses WS-017 P3) and reconcile the loader story to the materialized full-stack\nshell.\n\nThe P3 pages predated the runnable shell and described a SystemJS/System.import\nloader with path routing. Update them to the shipped reality: a single-spa\nroot-config served at a stable host, a native browser <script type=\"importmap\">\nthat maps bare specifiers to CDN URLs, native import(/* webpackIgnore */ spec)\nloading (Angular ng-serve emits ESM, not SystemJS-format bundles), hash routing\n(#route), and the simulated CDN cdn.dev.test.\n\nLoader-story reconciliation:\n- tutorial/build-a-micro-frontend.md: shell path -> frontend/shell/root-config.ts;\n  System.import + activeWhen: APP_PATH -> activeOnHash(''#notes'') + native\n  import(webpackIgnore); add the import-map/CDN explanation and cross-links.\n- reference/single-spa.md: add an \"Activating and loading an app\" section\n  grounding activeWhen (hash) and load (native import map), noting no SystemJS.\n- how-to/wire-the-session.md: the createShell example uses hash routing and the\n  native import map instead of activeWhen: ''/widgets'' + plain import().\n- how-to/diagnose-the-dev-loop.md: link the loading model and the serve how-to.\n\nNew pages:\n- explanation/how-micro-frontends-load.md: the loading model (shell, import map,\n  CDN, hash routing, import-map override, session-gated load), grounded in the\n  example shell files.\n- how-to/serve-the-shell-and-route-microfrontends.md: serve the shell and route\n  uFEs with `de project up -f shell.yaml`; kind: Shell topology, Method 1\n  (single-origin) and Method 2 (per-service API FQDNs), de ufe new roster,\n  default host app.dev.test (csp.dev.test in the Infoblox-CTO preset).\n\nWire both new pages into their section _index card lists. The top nav already\nlinks the devedge platform portal and the backend SDK. hugo --gc --minify is\ngreen (34 pages, exit 0); public/ and .hugo_build.lock stay gitignored.","tree":{"sha":"26ecf92459bd6024e751978b30efe7858cd80eaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/trees/26ecf92459bd6024e751978b30efe7858cd80eaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/commits/cce96c38d8c3b6147ea0033ea8afba419aec3d02","verification":{"payload":"tree 26ecf92459bd6024e751978b30efe7858cd80eaa\nparent b7d9656991ef7bc40154e2c968183b494f639aa4\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782941914 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782941914 -0500\n\ndocs: ship devedge-ufe-sdk site, reconciled to the shipped shell (#8)\n\nAdd the Hugo/Hextra documentation site for devedge-ufe-sdk (WS-018 Phase E,\ncloses WS-017 P3) and reconcile the loader story to the materialized full-stack\nshell.\n\nThe P3 pages predated the runnable shell and described a SystemJS/System.import\nloader with path routing. Update them to the shipped reality: a single-spa\nroot-config served at a stable host, a native browser <script type=\"importmap\">\nthat maps bare specifiers to CDN URLs, native import(/* webpackIgnore */ spec)\nloading (Angular ng-serve emits ESM, not SystemJS-format bundles), hash routing\n(#route), and the simulated CDN cdn.dev.test.\n\nLoader-story reconciliation:\n- tutorial/build-a-micro-frontend.md: shell path -> frontend/shell/root-config.ts;\n  System.import + activeWhen: APP_PATH -> activeOnHash(''#notes'') + native\n  import(webpackIgnore); add the import-map/CDN explanation and cross-links.\n- reference/single-spa.md: add an \"Activating and loading an app\" section\n  grounding activeWhen (hash) and load (native import map), noting no SystemJS.\n- how-to/wire-the-session.md: the createShell example uses hash routing and the\n  native import map instead of activeWhen: ''/widgets'' + plain import().\n- how-to/diagnose-the-dev-loop.md: link the loading model and the serve how-to.\n\nNew pages:\n- explanation/how-micro-frontends-load.md: the loading model (shell, import map,\n  CDN, hash routing, import-map override, session-gated load), grounded in the\n  example shell files.\n- how-to/serve-the-shell-and-route-microfrontends.md: serve the shell and route\n  uFEs with `de project up -f shell.yaml`; kind: Shell topology, Method 1\n  (single-origin) and Method 2 (per-service API FQDNs), de ufe new roster,\n  default host app.dev.test (csp.dev.test in the Infoblox-CTO preset).\n\nWire both new pages into their section _index card lists. The top nav already\nlinks the devedge platform portal and the backend SDK. hugo --gc --minify is\ngreen (34 pages, exit 0); public/ and .hugo_build.lock stay gitignored.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRYjaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASg8QAE+K9K9VUjdpgxiGb2Fvfpjh\n/hdfJA1be/7qDFdYqa2yBr3rfEK0HG5DfIXaJuNrO0ohRlo8UK6JdaHmXWuUS9uC\nBNzcQhHd8f4lndI7aWsl7HK6NDw8CxXeMfWswRfw5rTMBw0Gx6T57jV9JdBGYAu3\ncXa2nrI4cZsS5UoHjqd7h6BQdbWL5sYQzHiNEgD8rV71hdDMcr4LyXk/K1DbMu6v\nRSnYsXvfgpIw+Lg4uTIfhHyd4B7DoIHrD9yxh1OvUH6hv6strHjlFEYu1kPlU/ms\nwQTV3aeYC3pDQAWDESPe/u+YM+Ne0JbAfo79/vufCQgrJGwp7zxXmHld90dPVGFB\nT8cvXGXrL5TTutQz97b1VovyBrgUKBQX3coqMkTUqvljnEtpmLgFJHAc1gV+dNpM\nUEofOmmTjD/JdKbs6u6+6qXT9MeCQGI41gW