6029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/commits/b7d9656991ef7bc40154e2c968183b494f639aa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:14:42Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T21:14:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"examples: materialize runnable single-spa shell (native importmap + hash routing) (#7)\n\nAdd a deployable shell to the OSS full-stack example (WS-018 Phase D):\n\n- frontend/shell/{index.html,root-config.ts}: a single-spa root-config that\n  loads the uFE bundle via a NATIVE browser <script type=\"importmap\"> +\n  import(/* webpackIgnore: true */ ''notes-ufe''), not SystemJS (SystemJS cannot\n  load Angular''s ESM bundle from ng serve). uFEs are selected by HASH route\n  (#notes), so activeWhen is a predicate over location.hash and the uFE surface\n  never reaches the edge. Preserves shell-owns-session: OidcSessionProvider\n  instantiated once, GroupRegistry + assertNavContributions, createShell gates\n  registration on getToken() before start().\n- shell/{package.json,tsconfig.json}: type-check the shell standalone against\n  the packages installed under notes-ufe/node_modules (via paths).\n- notes-ufe/src/shell/main.ts: fix the loader — drop System.import for the same\n  native dynamic import, and switch to hash routing. Kept as the in-src twin of\n  the deployable root-config.\n- shell.yaml (kind: Shell, Method 1): the topology de project up -f routes —\n  shell at notesapp.dev.test/, API same-origin at /api -> notesd, uFE bundle\n  from cdn.dev.test/notes/, uFE mounted at #notes. Validated against the CLI''s\n  ParseShell.\n- README: document the runnable topology, hash routing, native-importmap\n  loading (and why: Angular ESM), and the shell-owns-session flow.","tree":{"sha":"eca4ae18f40926bddde92a05583e853ad07b27e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/trees/eca4ae18f40926bddde92a05583e853ad07b27e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/commits/b7d9656991ef7bc40154e2c968183b494f639aa4","verification":{"payload":"tree eca4ae18f40926bddde92a05583e853ad07b27e1\nparent d1b21d600725348ffc6921d8f66a4eeb1cc486e6\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782940482 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782940482 -0500\n\nexamples: materialize runnable single-spa shell (native importmap + hash routing) (#7)\n\nAdd a deployable shell to the OSS full-stack example (WS-018 Phase D):\n\n- frontend/shell/{index.html,root-config.ts}: a single-spa root-config that\n  loads the uFE bundle via a NATIVE browser <script type=\"importmap\"> +\n  import(/* webpackIgnore: true */ ''notes-ufe''), not SystemJS (SystemJS cannot\n  load Angular''s ESM bundle from ng serve). uFEs are selected by HASH route\n  (#notes), so activeWhen is a predicate over location.hash and the uFE surface\n  never reaches the edge. Preserves shell-owns-session: OidcSessionProvider\n  instantiated once, GroupRegistry + assertNavContributions, createShell gates\n  registration on getToken() before start().\n- shell/{package.json,tsconfig.json}: type-check the shell standalone against\n  the packages installed under notes-ufe/node_modules (via paths).\n- notes-ufe/src/shell/main.ts: fix the loader — drop System.import for the same\n  native dynamic import, and switch to hash routing. Kept as the in-src twin of\n  the deployable root-config.\n- shell.yaml (kind: Shell, Method 1): the topology de project up -f routes —\n  shell at notesapp.dev.test/, API same-origin at /api -> notesd, uFE bundle\n  from cdn.dev.test/notes/, uFE mounted at #notes. Validated against the CLI''s\n  ParseShell.\n- README: document the runnable topology, hash routing, native-importmap\n  loading (and why: Angular ESM), and the shell-owns-session flow.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRYNCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbV8QAA606pksdy/KmLE/XP/yzz8w\niN7Y9/67+n5qa5XH9xdv9dXOMgpMcCcN5xn569bl5U8qY/C7qzPJLH3ppYzJ8JpR\nfPyq7prQE0N9WMgMMma0548cMOEeaSrKyNX6Fu91FsVfJeQ1wNGoGDudvQClL30i\neDRsBS80aRtbSWgV1d1dJohlRHWmZ+ajW69Pm7/tc7/hGCj29b0TOIaWz0wqzNgH\nNRjc/w/cJ2u5gTRohIRE6iFzTYaAJbfRnpHiWiVgL00g/L4HZH6vQTfdvp4YOP9Y\nkRJAPHfaHKO+T0VSa6RhdRl0Pwi3muxlpx3xdcxcRC+ECA77aoCGZSBiAgUpZUhM\nQ3r1SZ6+DnhYFb+7rUdEfwx+qd6Z6cbEGhugGqb02yJXpCQsmYUV7RyYtt+Wkc9S\nD8QZ3TZi4xx/jXSzIo/w2fdg3aAoCnOYwkUjhVzejJ2zpVBnaf8FtSq6PT/ybqX3\nvDFz2cppg4cB9abKwKe2cXwzQz5IXk5RSG4D1VWGPbHgn4hBiIgOtpETVuQkjA5R\nLn0nszseKUUWvche2LhaM+Igc2y1MP2Ipj2038ZDvTBRBqmsJ6InISgdTPMcY1p8\ny4JJeZaeh3dASE/DWX6uniUggoMA/DlHJJZCao2qyBKZJyT5I/IKQJAtNzy2qcVh\nmsfL4h8LLgzEKDUZsTxd\n=8m+L\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-01T21:14:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{