hanges.\n\nBump all packages to 0.1.2 to republish updated metadata + READMEs to GitHub\nPackages (0.1.1 is already on the registry and cannot be overwritten).","tree":{"sha":"88c1262e064c7310fa9646a91de1113abae3d344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/trees/88c1262e064c7310fa9646a91de1113abae3d344"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/commits/fab8c6cc126bb2534aad780ae5bcf5e633a9bcf2","verification":{"payload":"tree 88c1262e064c7310fa9646a91de1113abae3d344\nparent 0f9867d0d9850c27894bd5382aac54c6f2fd39b6\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782923058 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782923058 -0500\n\nrelease: v0.1.2 — vendor-neutral docs (#5)\n\nRework the README, package docs, examples, and the oidc package description to\nbe provider- and vendor-neutral: identity providers (Okta/Auth0/Keycloak) are\nnamed only as generic examples, and the open-core/private-binding governance\nstory is told without naming any proprietary implementation — matching how\ndevedge-sdk describes its seams. No runtime code changes.\n\nBump all packages to 0.1.2 to republish updated metadata + READMEs to GitHub\nPackages (0.1.1 is already on the registry and cannot be overwritten).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRT8yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1vIQAJOF/43TRuoVtl/q0JjjThNO\n9yQeZ51Vh1ot23LG5/jDLYr+psPV/ZsxF4a8g2hwaJqeo0/QpE9EWfW1pQHJofCp\nRhwZqye6GrUMsK4ySxjgLCrxHadne43Ucjw2BU3MS88Sy7jOJ+fmiA5GG+smH4nR\nvgDz8DmlVqlzA4iF7P4y8xBShc/do0kY7+R41orukdXa7Yr3t/OuPcvpo6xjQlJD\na22KZ+kKPbLy89p7ajLSdpJbepmb5sS7CfDGVuPDmlOEOwhFDvYm59QKLDVuk2Q3\nV7OCoxumwn+Hg5rZMQIaKLVo39+rxUvV244BxxMUde7mBgKltGrnmrffVEb739b9\nH97hI/d6l6jzR2zSKrdkUa2oLOIrahzhqw5mGNVTdLKit7/2MFApV5NwF7Cvtr+y\nPSwsdhxz1pLTvYG7GtLD2ZcMduhy9J7XG+FTCsorBkOShjTbAdjAGgu5HHcWMXGV\nS5FE0ZCCDESNouhyf3zhNiwcNor7WWli9YC+3tb9NrKFTabop8dcoaf1g3E3by8q\nxinLjgVqvxrJuVLGf6H9XTXFOxrFxGVJZMH1164w/iF8seRR8OdC6vDMkr4zCiN+\nalnbHTKWM