27","sha":"de84417ab7bf231a6fb667f622e941298c535127","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/commits/de84417ab7bf231a6fb667f622e941298c535127"}],"sha":"0f9867d0d9850c27894bd5382aac54c6f2fd39b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/commits/0f9867d0d9850c27894bd5382aac54c6f2fd39b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/commits/de84417ab7bf231a6fb667f622e941298c535127/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:53:43Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:53:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"harden: origin-scope tokens, auth edge cases, publish-readiness (v0.1.1) (#3)\n\n* harden: origin-scope tokens, fix auth edge cases, publish-readiness\n\nSecurity:\n- core createAuthedFetch: attach Bearer same-origin-by-default; optional\n  allowedOrigins allowlist; no token to third-party origins.\n- angular bearerAuthInterceptor: add API_ORIGINS token (default\n  [location.origin]); attach only to allowed origins.\n\nCorrectness:\n- core createAuthedFetch: rebuild the request per send so a 401 retry no\n  longer reuses a consumed body (URL+init and Request-object paths).\n- oidc getToken: memoize the in-flight silent refresh so concurrent callers\n  share one signinSilent.\n- single-spa createShell: apply shell session after caller customProps so it\n  cannot be overridden.\n\nHardening:\n- core StubSessionProvider: warn loudly on construction (dev-only).\n- oidc: add stateStore ''localStorage'' | ''memory'' (default localStorage);\n  document the XSS tradeoff.\n\nPublish-readiness:\n- add .github/workflows/release.yml (tag-triggered npm publish, provenance,\n  inert without NPM_TOKEN).\n- add per-package README.md and repository/homepage/bugs metadata.\n- add SECURITY.md documenting token posture and the constrained Angular-15\n  transitive advisories.\n\nDependencies:\n- bump vitest ^1.6.0 -> ^3.2.6 and override vite ^7 / esbuild ^0.25 to clear\n  the vitest/vite/esbuild advisories; all tests green.\n- pin angular devDeps to ^15.2.10, add @angular/compiler, align zone.js\n  ~0.13.3 (fixes the previously-failing interceptor test on Angular 15).\n- approve esbuild build script via pnpm.onlyBuiltDependencies (silences the\n  benign ignored-build-scripts notice).\n\n* release: bump packages to 0.1.1 (hardened release)","tree":{"sha":"f89dee913be2072a75eecd4d311d7956593c0b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/trees/f89dee913be2072a75eecd4d311d7956593c0b5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-sdk/git/commits/de84417ab7bf231a6fb667f622e941298c535127","verification":{"payload":"tree f89dee913be2072a75eecd4d311d7956593c0b5f\nparent c08bc69ca8ebc66d2b6286ab2a1d9f24ebc93704\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782888823 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782888823 -0500\n\nharden: origin-scope tokens, auth edge cases, publish-readiness (v0.1.1) (#3)\n\n* harden: origin-scope tokens, fix auth edge cases, publish-readiness\n\nSecurity:\n- core createAuthedFetch: attach Bearer same-origin-by-default; optional\n  allowedOrigins allowlist; no token to third-party origins.\n- angular bearerAuthInterceptor: add API_ORIGINS token (default\n  [location.origin]); attach only to allowed origins.\n\nCorrectness:\n- core createAuthedFetch: rebuild the request per send so a 401 retry no\n  longer reuses a consumed body (URL+init and Request-object paths).\n- oidc getToken: memoize the in-flight silent refresh so concurrent callers\n  share one signinSilent.\n- single-spa createShell: apply shell session after caller customProps so it\n  cannot be overridden.\n\nHardening:\n- core StubSessionProvider: warn loudly on construction (dev-only).\n- oidc: add stateStore ''localStorage'' | ''memory'' (default localStorage);\n  document the XSS tradeoff.\n\nPublish-readiness:\n- add .github/workflows/release.yml (tag-triggered npm publish, provenance,\n  inert without NPM_TOKEN).\n- add per-package README.md and repository/homepage/bugs metadata.\n- add SECURITY.md documenting token posture and the constrained Angular-15\n  transitive advisories.\n\nDependencies:\n- bump vitest ^1.6.0 -> ^3.2.6 and override vite ^7 / esbuild ^0.25 to clear\n  the vitest/vite/esbuild advisories; all tests green.\n- pin angular devDeps to ^15.2.10, add @angular/compiler, align zone.js\n  ~0.13.3 (fixes the previously-failing interceptor test on Angular 15).\n- approve esbuild build script via pnpm.onlyBuiltDependencies (silences the\n  benign ignored-build-scripts notice).\n\n* release: bump packages to 0.1.1 (hardened release)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRLl3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkMgQAAKucguWQcRk07I+yPojaQn8\nl8DPKWaGKPbYqb61/CWrfauTiG5Nwr3biSyiZwwIjX2B3uvUtTFnooGKpbjry+fD\nmM5SwffY3vz0v1z9qCeU7UFhI3w7tCmR0wKOokvp91hPs6bI301QS+Vm+9216xR+\nKGA3EJh8aTKTi