ts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:42:01Z","email":"138521685+harshmaharaj@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jha_harsh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:42:01Z","email":"138521685+harshmaharaj@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jha_harsh"},"message":"feat(runtime): resume tour on the page the user lands on when they skip \"Next\" [adop-sdk]\n\nIf the user navigates to the next page without clicking \"Next\", the tour used\nto stay stuck on the previous step and hide. Now:\n\n- TourPlayer.handleRouteChange fast-forwards to the first *subsequent* step of\n  the same flow whose route matches the page just landed on, so the walkthrough\n  continues from where the user actually is.\n- Tour progress {flowId, stepIndex} is persisted to sessionStorage on each step\n  and cleared when the tour ends, so a real navigation or full page reload can\n  resume via SDK.resumePersistedTour() at the pending or a later step.\n- TourPlayer.start(flow, startIndex) supports resuming mid-flow.\n\nClicking \"Next\" is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"c3a64190a9849bc4a3336e209305519544cb673b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mr-Dev-Anshu/adop-sdk/git/trees/c3a64190a9849bc4a3336e209305519544cb673b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mr-Dev-Anshu/adop-sdk/git/commits/a895aa5cf0a392761a2f21aebb6af8f532cec3e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138521685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kumar-builds/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kumar-builds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kumar-builds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kumar-builds/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kumar-builds","id":138521685,"login":"kumar-builds","node_id":"U_kgDOCEGsVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kumar-