":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamika","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mr-Dev-Anshu/adop-sdk/commits/6235573301bb7975d116eee2724c13fe5d839d6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T16:24:57Z","email":"anamika190594@gmail.com","name":"Anamika Sharma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:05:18Z","email":"anamika190594@gmail.com","name":"Anamika Sharma"},"message":"Fix builder mode using hardcoded external domain instead of configured host\n\nSDK.js, InspectorEngine.js and BuilderMode.js had 4 fetch calls hardcoded\nto https://hirehunt.sheryians.com (an unrelated external domain), which\nmeant buildKey verification and step-saving in Builder Mode always failed\nagainst a real backend, silently disabling Builder Mode.\n\nAdd a configurable `host` option (defaults to http://localhost:3000) and\nthread it through SDK -> BuilderMode -> InspectorEngine, replacing every\nhardcoded URL. Also updates the vanilla/react test app placeholder API keys.","tree":{"sha":"071cebd584fdcd9c1e616efb8f6ba7e92631f3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mr-Dev-Anshu/adop-sdk/git/trees/071cebd584fdcd9c1e616efb8f6ba7e92631f3de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mr-Dev-Anshu/adop-sdk/git/commits/6235573301bb7975d116eee2724c13fe5d839d6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12938130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharmamik