10-08T13:12:30Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v3.4.0: Career becomes Interviews — rounds, per-company prep, question log\n\nApplications are sent by the hundreds outside the app, so tracking them\nhere was dead weight: a company is now added only once a phone screen is\nbooked, then prepared for specifically and every interviewer question is\nkept. Job Alerts, the Topic Quiz and the Applied stage are removed; the\nCareer Life Score, Needs Attention signals, Prep readiness and the Career\nbot are rebuilt around live interview processes, rounds and logged\nquestions, and the next interview surfaces in Prep''s War header and the\nmorning coach message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"459f341a3b00c883c5e3a3bb10185b3edddfffab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/459f341a3b00c883c5e3a3bb10185b3edddfffab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/626b5b7f8dbb315edb2ba8c380d198fb6c4ca59f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"