ame":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:06:59Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v3.3.0: remove the Learning module\n\nLearning no longer fits the interview sprint: the resource tracker, daily\nread, AI/tech tip, Learning Telegram bot, its crons and four AI tasks are\nremoved. Life Score drops Learning and reweights to Health 30 / Finance 25\n/ Career 25 / Coding 20; Daily Mission, digests, Explain My Score, Monthly\nReview and the Brain context follow. Prep''s normal plan uses a concept\nquiz instead of the daily read. Resource data stays in the database.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad51f2c2b01a3b9b3424b1be4ab9092a16f17553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/ad51f2c2b01a3b9b3424b1be4ab9092a16f17553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/2ea636d26ec5ff736788453ad8970128f460d1f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type"