10-07T16:13:01Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v3.2.0: Interview War Mode — focus timer, readiness gates, adaptive plan, Telegram coach\n\nSix weeks to the Nov 18 target: Prep now decides what to do next, makes\nit a timed focus session, measures it, and shifts tomorrow''s time toward\nthe biggest interview risk. Readiness is gated per area with a\nbottleneck penalty so one weak area can''t hide behind strong ones; stored\nAI answer ratings feed topic weakness, a topic-level revision queue and\nreadiness. The Daily bot coaches the day (7:30 mission, 1pm behind-pace,\n9:30pm review, Sunday forecast) and drives the same focus sessions.\nAll scoring and allocation stays deterministic; AI only reviews answers\nand writes the weekly forecast.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f102c028c5527869c7a61f9900c0697c99943504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/f102c028c5527869c7a61f9900c0697c99943504"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/83402076f8a38db4204cd5156fb3340e5e8d2c77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur