","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:07:19Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:07:19Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v3.1.0: one-click rated AI review for Mock Rounds + Mock Interview Calendar\n\nReviewing each mock answer separately was slow and cost one call per\nanswer; one Haiku call now reviews the whole round, rates every answer\n1-10 (round score averaged in code) and is stored on the round so it is\nnever re-run. A Mock Interview Calendar keeps every round with its\nanswers and review. The Questions tab''s AI review now returns a 1-10\nrating as well.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7105497085eda1f8354fbd58b37d6035095825e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/7105497085eda1f8354fbd58b37d6035095825e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/12e27a96b3177ab7c76f26d5d39cee5bbffe131f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/12e27a96b3177ab7c76f26d5d39cee5bbffe131f","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDEyZTI3YTk2YjMxNzdhYjdjNzZmMjZkNWQzOWNlZTViYmZmZTEzMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4","sha":"f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4"}],"sha":"12e27a96b3177ab7c76f26d5d39cee5bbffe131f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/12e27a96b3177ab7c76f26d5d39cee5bbffe131f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:44:11Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:44:11Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v3.0.0: remove Planner, Mock Round replaces Flashcards, no self-grading\n\nPlanner no longer fits the job-hunt focus, so the module is gone: page,\nnav, Quick Add task, Plan Coach and Executive Summary, plus the linked\ntasks Coding/Learning/Health created and every place tasks fed the\ndashboard, Brain and crons. Its Telegram bot stays as the Daily bot so\nbriefings, digests, reminders and the scheduled messages keep working.\nTask data is kept in the DB.\n\nPrep: Flashcards were mostly article trivia and answer-less cards, so a\ntimed Mock Round (screen / behavioral / system design) replaces them.\nMissed/Partial/Confident grading is removed everywhere in favor of\nSkip / Next and on-demand AI review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e8e2306efc18e851d483f7e818d664305f3b305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/3e8e2306efc18e851d483f7e818d664305f3b305"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKGY3Y2Y2MWJkZWZiNjc0MTg4ZjU4MTQxY2MxM2I0MDJlZWFiM2IwYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/c79a379df3b61fdf967a099082180e91ef5f3137","sha":"c79a379df3b61fdf967a099082180e91ef5f3137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/c79a379df3b61fdf967a099082180e91ef5f3137"}],"sha":"f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/f7cf61bdefb674188f58141cc13b402eeab3b0c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/c79a379df3b61fdf967a099082180e91ef5f3137/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:56:05Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:56:05Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v2.0.7: run Prep feedback on Haiku to fit the low AI budget\n\nThe daily AI budget stays at ~$0.17, which only fit ~18 Sonnet critiques\na day — far fewer than a full Job Hunt day needs. Haiku cuts a critique\nfrom ~$0.0045 to ~$0.0014 with the same prompts and response shape.\n\n- story_critique, ai_native_critique, answer_critique -> Haiku\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2bdb53db46b2ea6ceba1f2b2d690c37c6147c81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/d2bdb53db46b2ea6ceba1f2b2d690c37c6147c81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/c79a379df3b61fdf967a099082180e91ef5f3137","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/su