,"email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v2.0.4: AI-native section in the Prep Question Bank\n\nInterviews at AI-native companies (Apollo JD) probe whether you\npressure-test and verify AI output, not just use it — a gap the bank\ndidn''t cover at all.\n\n- 115 ''ai-native'' questions: the 76-question Apollo reference list plus\n  39 additions (building AI features in the frontend, prompting, agents,\n  security, leading adoption, LLM basics, scenarios), in a seeded\n  practice order with expected areas as answer hints\n- AI interviewer feedback on typed answers (ai_native_critique, Sonnet,\n  uncached); last answer is prefilled on review so answers get refined\n- Job Hunt Mode quotas rebalanced so all 115 are covered by the target\n- Readiness matrix gains an AI-native engineering row\n- Fix: \"Skip for now\" re-sorted the skipped question back to the front\n- Fix: page the bank past PostgREST''s 1,000-row cap; Coding pool queries\n  exclude ai-native rows so they stay under it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf91d16785f08b2ab1f37cf74ca7b473a4808da7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/bf91d16785f08b2ab1f37cf74ca7b473a4808da7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/7db452c542478f01e97af434686640569f73291f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organi