subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/b919e6cd203527eb5596b54363b19ad23d9f6075/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:24:19Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:24:19Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"v2.0.3: Job Hunt Mode + Question Bank coverage sprint\n\nLaid off with interviews targeted for 2026-10-15 at 10 h/day, so Prep\nneeds to fill a full day and track coverage of the existing ~905-question\nbank, not just run a 45-min daily session.\n\n- Job Hunt Mode (prep_settings): target date + hours/day turn Today''s Prep\n  into a full-day plan with per-category question quotas sized to days left\n- Questions tab: self-graded sprint over coding_questions (unseen first,\n  then partial/missed), partial/missed -> flashcards, coverage per category\n  with projected coverage by the target date; Coding completions count\n- question_progress table; flashcards source gains ''question_bank''\n- ROADMAP-v2 §9 re-plans v2.1 around the job hunt\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bae3c3e9a3fa6a5622bf2b01479a11a4fe6cbe5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/bae3c3e9a3fa6a5622bf2b01479a11a4fe6cbe5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/b919e6cd203527eb5596b54363b19ad23d9f6075","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":