ithub.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/3b47ce68e5c0138e8a5c12e87f255867353dcec4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:49:44Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:49:44Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"UI v2.2a: faster Dashboard, per-page skeletons, shared PageHeader/StatCard, contrast\n\n- Dashboard: batch the life-score history read with the other queries and\n  defer the score upsert via after() (service client) - warm load ~2.6-3.9s\n  -> ~1.6-2.0s locally; verified the deferred write still lands.\n- Per-route loading.tsx built from a new PageSkeleton describing each\n  page''s real layout (no more jump from one generic skeleton).\n- PageHeader + HeaderChip replace 10 hand-rolled headers (design''s -0.02em\n  title tracking); StatCard restyled to the design tile (uppercase label,\n  value, optional sub) and adopted by Health/Prep/Finance/Coding, replacing\n  five drifted variants, with sub-lines from already-fetched data.\n- Card drops its h-full default (grid rows stretch anyway); removes the\n  six per-card !h-auto patches.\n- Contrast: informational text moved off text-fg-quaternary (~2.5:1) to\n  text-fg-tertiary (~4.8:1); interactive/hover affordances unchanged.\n- Settings: \"astrology-daily\" label + title-case fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"451e144d1492ad6f8cc9813e938da62673cceab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/451e144d1492ad6f8cc9813e938da62673cceab3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinay