thub.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/a62420c22fc9edf261e1ee95dd9ed8909b5d1bcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:54:36Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:54:36Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Astrology: crisp bullet Telegram messages, tighter prompts, fix characteristics reply\n\nThe daily push and bot replies were multi-paragraph prose (~250 words for\nthe daily reading). New telegram-format.ts renders them as short bullets:\n1-line gist, <=3 favorable / <=2 avoid, 1-line mood; monthly/yearly <=4\nand characteristics <=5 sentence bullets; panchang one line per item.\nAI prompts (shared with the web page) now ask for one-sentence summaries,\n3-8 word phrases, and word-capped sentences. \"my characteristics\" sent\n\"[object Object]\" (the {text, generatedAt} result was interpolated whole).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c21fef25e7b95fb4d7d12c55bb3f2e171711973b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/c21fef25e7b95fb4d7d12c