email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:04:17Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Cross-module audit fixes: stale auto-task cleanup, weak areas, budget tile, active apps\n\n- Planner had 101 open tasks, all auto-generated daily coding picks and\n  reads, growing every day. The daily-coding cron now removes Planner\n  tasks for picks/reads left open 3+ days (the question/resource itself\n  stays pending in Practice Log / Learning).\n- Coding Weak Areas listed topics with zero struggles (\"0 of 2\n  struggled · 0%\"); require at least one struggle.\n- Dashboard budget tile rendered \"₹-14,185\"; now \"Over ₹14,185\", and\n  no NaN tiers when no budget is set.\n- Career header counted rejected applications as active.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f740765c9aa872f457caa637e39336d3cd7cc0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/f740765c9aa872f457caa637e39336d3cd7cc0d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/2d4ccf65e54fe9ac55b8b8cb2fc5779cd94dc7a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/2d4ccf65e54fe9ac55b8b8cb2fc5779cd94dc7a9","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDJkNGNjZjY1ZTU0ZmU5YWM1NWI4YjhjYjJmYzU3NzljZDk0ZGM3YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328","sha":"1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328"}],"sha":"2d4ccf65e54fe9ac55b8b8cb2fc5779cd94dc7a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/2d4ccf65e54fe9ac55b8b8cb2fc5779cd94dc7a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T19:51:36Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T19:51:36Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Health: one workout streak, real total, week-based calendar, no red 0 each morning\n\n- Workout stats read the `workouts` log instead of `daily_workouts`,\n  whose history is pruned to 7: the \"N completed\" count was stuck at 7\n  and its streak disagreed with the calendar''s. Card, calendar, and\n  Dashboard now share one streak/total.\n- Calendar: non-workout days are neutral Rest, not red Missed; each week\n  row shows workouts vs the weekly plan, plus weeks-on-plan.\n- Before anything score-relevant is logged today, the header shows\n  yesterday''s score in neutral instead of a red \"0/100 Getting Started\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa5a35c7a7b3f7dd492590845cb36da811250994","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/fa5a35c7a7b3f7dd492590845cb36da811250994"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDFjZGE4MjMzNzVhMzYwZjI5ZWZlYjBmZGQ2MjQzY2QwYWM0ZjYzMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/d6ff47263b3fb5cc952d718c4a1fa76b43145b74","sha":"d6ff47263b3fb5cc952d718c4a1fa76b43145b74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/d6ff47263b3fb5cc952d718c4a1fa76b43145b74"}],"sha":"1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/1cda823375a360f29efeb0fdd6243cd0ac4f6328"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/d6ff47263b3fb5cc952d718c4a1fa76b43145b74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T19:39:18Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T19:39:18Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Health: workout Change picker, activity-level check, weight trend, food list\n\nA usage audit found 45 of 53 daily workouts \"skipped\" - mostly rerolls\nseconds apart to reach the workout actually wanted; the profile''s Active\nlevel set a 2,471 kcal target projecting ~1 kg/week loss while real data\nshowed ~1.8 workouts/week and ~0.26 kg/week; weight trend wasn''t visible\nanywhere; and Telegram-logged food had no web view to review or correct.\n\n- Change: swap the active workout''s category in place (no skipped row,\n  same Planner task), so the split continues from what was done\n- Activity check: suggest the level the last 28 days of workouts/steps\n  imply, with the resulting target; one-click Update, never automatic\n- Weight Trend card: sparkline, regression kg/week vs plan pace, ETA to\n  normal BMI\n- Workouts / Week tile (actual vs plan) replaces Carbs / Fat\n- Today''s Food list with per-item delete; shared removeFoodLogEntry()\n  also backs the Telegram undo button\n- README: drop the stale HealthTrend.tsx claim\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1afac66556fefd1b86011c1286f76ada3ce7f76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/a1afac66556fefd1b86011c1286f76ada3ce7f76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/d6ff47263b3fb5cc952d718c4a1fa76b43145b74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{