:"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/f4fadd54df73b4ba1aef2939b8ecab4bd232a884/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T11:43:56Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T11:43:56Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Replace Coding daily-pick \"Open\" button with a link icon + clickable card\n\nThe question link is now a small external-link icon beside the title\ninstead of a separate full-width button, freeing that row for\nMark Solved/Answered alone at full width. The whole card body also\nopens the link in a new tab on click (icon and Mark button both stop\npropagation so they don''t double-trigger it).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4460da442cc909716977987054f43f7f35536b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/d4460da442cc909716977987054f43f7f35536b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/f4fadd54df73b4ba1aef2939b8ecab4bd232a884","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/f4fadd54df73b4ba1aef2939b8ecab4bd232a884","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKGY0ZmFkZDU0ZGY3M2I0YmExYWVmMjkzOWI4ZWNhYjRiZDIzMmE4ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12","sha":"ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12"}],"sha":"f4fadd54df73b4ba1aef2939b8ecab4bd232a884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/f4fadd54df73b4ba1aef2939b8ecab4bd232a884"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:09:56Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:09:56Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Life Score v2: blend today''s raw score with a 7-day average per module\n\nEvery module score is now dailyRaw*0.6 + weeklyAvg*0.4 instead of a\npure daily snapshot, so it actually responds to logged values instead\nof just logged presence -- the bug that prompted this: eating well\nover a fat-loss calorie target didn''t move the score at all, because\nthe old Health formula only checked whether calories were logged, not\nwhether the value was any good.\n\n- Health reuses the real nutrition/activity accuracy formula (falls\n  back to the old presence-only calc when no health_profile exists).\n- Finance''s bands are smoothed instead of a hard cliff at 90% of\n  budget.\n- Career rewards recurring activity (quiz attempts in the last 30\n  days, job alerts tracked into applications) instead of one-time\n  static fillers.\n- Coding weights algorithm/system-design questions higher than\n  quiz/JS-function/UI-coding picks.\n- Learning is unchanged -- no other \"touched recently\" signal exists\n  since study-time logging was removed.\n\nRaw daily sub-scores are still the only thing ever persisted to\nlife_score_logs (never the blend), so the weekly average can''t\nrecursively smooth itself into unmovability. Explain My Score now\nshows each module''s full today/week-avg/blended breakdown instead of\na single delta-from-yesterday number.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a575a1cd14e1fb604c9d2aa703c84f9d041465c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/5a575a1cd14e1fb604c9d2aa703c84f9d041465c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKGVkNzJmOWQxZmEzZjU0NzVmNTZmYTZmODQyMWI3MDJmMGE2MDhlMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/5ceaef6894a93629b028cd971a193f5d60ba3df4","sha":"5ceaef6894a93629b028cd971a193f5d60ba3df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/5ceaef6894a93629b028cd971a193f5d60ba3df4"}],"sha":"ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ed72f9d1fa3f5475f56fa6f8421b702f0a608e12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/5ceaef6894a93629b028cd971a193f5d60ba3df4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T18:19:42Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T18:19:42Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Fix Algorithm Question card''s button alignment to not rely on coincidence\n\nThe inner pick div lost its flex context in an uncommitted local edit\nthat flattened its nested-card visual style, which meant mt-auto had\nno effect on the button row -- it only looked bottom-aligned today\nbecause every card''s content happened to be a similar height. Restored\nflex-1 flex flex-col on the pick div (kept the flattened background/\nborder removal) so the alignment holds regardless of content length.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23a7058a7