"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/8b994f6d62e656cf5ec2089430ef47944db400e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:19:41Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:19:41Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Learning quiz-completion flow, Coding/Career/Health card restructures\n\n- Learning: finishing the mandatory completion quiz now rolls into the\n  Log Study Session modal instead of a separate click; quiz results now\n  show every question with color-coded options, not just the misses.\n- Coding: Today''s Algorithm Question moved into the shared Card\n  component; Open/Mark buttons now share one row with shorter link\n  text; removed the Easy/Medium/Hard box; paired Weak Areas with the\n  Contribution Calendar instead of the Algorithm card.\n- Career: Job Alerts is no longer a tab -- always visible below\n  Applications.\n- Health: removed the ad-hoc Workouts log card (still loggable via\n  Telegram), replaced by Health Tip of the Day paired with the Workout\n  Calendar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0bf06298094bd1f2748933496467c9a4402d2c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/e0bf06298094bd1f2748933496467c9a4402d2c9"},"url":"https://api.github.co