rl":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/a78152230223bb18d75b4de1950dc76f123c2652/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:20:48Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:20:48Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Security model doc, threshold consolidation, cost-by-module, AI freshness timestamps\n\n- Documented the single-user security model (README) and fixed the\n  signup-lockdown ordering gap in deploy instructions - it previously\n  described a real exposure window (public signup, then lock it down)\n  without emphasizing you must not leave that gap open.\n- Consolidated every Risk/Automation Rule/Opportunity threshold (5%/15%/25%\n  budget tiers, 20% protein decline, 7-day streak, 15% calorie overage,\n  3-application momentum) from scattered magic numbers into\n  src/lib/thresholds.ts.\n- Added a Spend by Module breakdown to Settings'' AI Budget card\n  (src/lib/ai-task-modules.ts''s TASK_MODULE, Record<AITask,...> so\n  TypeScript enforces every current task has an entry) - also fixed the\n  inline TASK_LABEL that was missing ~16 of 31 current tasks and had one\n  dead entry.\n- Fixed 5 \"always send\" cron AI tasks (daily_briefing, weekly_digest,\n  monthly_digest, daily_journal, evening_reflection) that fell back to an\n  empty string on AI failure - askAI() already never throws (guarantees a\n  fallback), but an empty string left a silent gap in an otherwise-normal\n  message. Now a clear one-line \"unavailable\" message.\n- Added askAIWithMeta() (thin wrapper, askAI() unchanged for all other\n  call sites) returning generatedAt alongside the text, wired into the 3\n  AI-derived cards with a real staleness risk (Career''s Recommended Topic\n  and Interview Guidance, Astrology''s year-cached Characteristics) - each\n  now shows \"Updated {relative time}\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5af274853b41202b4afd7925ac747ba6b443b76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/5af274853b41202b4afd7925ac747ba6b443b76e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/a78152230223bb18d75b4de1950dc76f123c2652","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/a78152230223bb18d75b4de1950dc76f123c2652","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKGE3ODE1MjIzMDIyM2JiMThkNzViNGRlMTk1MGRjNzZmMTIzYzI2NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/eac844264d2c258bcf2cb2440e1ef1f6454d30df","sha":"eac844264d2c258bcf2cb2440e1ef1f6454d30df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/eac844264d2c258bcf2cb2440e1ef1f6454d30df"}],"sha":"a78152230223bb18d75b4de1950dc76f123c2652","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/a78152230223bb18d75b4de1950dc76f123c2652"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/eac844264d2c258bcf2cb2440e1ef1f6454d30df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T02:28:19Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T02:28:19Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Pin swisseph-wasm exact version; audit its bundle scope; drop dead XP write\n\n- swisseph-wasm exact-pinned (0.1.0, no ^) - two prior production bugs\n  came from this dependency''s interaction with Vercel''s tracer/webpack,\n  so a routine `npm update` could silently reintroduce either.\n- Audited its bundle scope (per outputFileTracingIncludes already using\n  the astrology-only pattern): confirmed via .nft.json that swisseph.wasm\n  + swisseph.data (~2.75MB) leak into the shared Telegram webhook route''s\n  bundle for all 7 bots, not just Astrology''s, because handler.ts\n  statically imports every module into one dispatch object. Converting to\n  dynamic imports would NOT fix this (Vercel''s tracer resolves literal\n  dynamic imports identically to static ones) - the real fix needs\n  Astrology''s webhook split into its own function. Documented as a known\n  issue in next.config.ts rather than attempted as a risky unattended\n  refactor to a live, frequently-used routing path.\n- Removed gamification (XP/level/streak/badges) computation and its\n  per-dashboard-load user_xp upsert from getDashboardData() - a real\n  write on the highest-traffic page for a UI element that was removed\n  from DashboardView.tsx a while back. user_xp table itself untouched\n  (still read by Settings'' Data Export).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81682d04e07614104b24ca49cf4d1f9fedc35f25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/81682d04e07614104b24ca49cf4d1f9fedc35f25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/eac844264d2c258bcf2cb2440e1ef1f6454d30df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":fa