204098/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T02:18:29Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T02:18:29Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Schema debt cleanup: drop 5 orphaned tables + 8 dead columns\n\nConfirmed zero remaining code readers/writers for each (grepped all of\nsrc/, not just trusting old doc comments) before dropping:\n\n- goals, coding_quiz_attempts, resume_versions, trending_readings,\n  interview_qa tables\n- investments'' 4 SIP columns (is_sip, sip_amount, sip_day_of_month,\n  sip_last_contribution_month)\n- health_metrics.sleep_hours/water_ml\n- health_profile.target_weight_kg/goal_deadline\n\ntrending_readings and the two health_profile columns still had live (if\nfunctionally pointless) reads/writes in planner/actions.ts,\ntelegram/handler.ts, health/actions.ts, health/types.ts, and\nHealthProfileForm.tsx - removed those references in this same change,\nbefore dropping. interview_qa likewise had one live read in Settings''\nData Export - removed there too.\n\nBoth migrations already applied and independently verified against the\nlive schema (PGRST205/42703 on every dropped table/column).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b90e8123f64a9e18631dfd695a5501f7749be48b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/b90e8123f64a9e18631dfd695a5501f7749be48b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/ca6b64d3719bf9059b7bc650b50c1f7cbd204098","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/othe