ysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/473e2336e5e10b385e8c15e9286c8eb490b23aac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:18:24Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:18:24Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Redesign Job Alerts: Ashby source, deterministic salary/skill scoring\n\nCompany list expanded 16 -> ~49 by adding Ashby (a third free, public,\nno-auth ATS API alongside Greenhouse/Lever) - reaches OpenAI, Notion,\nRamp, Linear, Vercel, Perplexity, Cursor, and other high-paying companies\nthe old list couldn''t. LinkedIn/Naukri were evaluated and ruled out: no\ncompliant public API without an enterprise contract.\n\nEach new posting is now scored 0-100, deterministically (seniority +\nskill overlap with tracked Skills + salary vs. current_salary, parsed\nfrom the posting text) - never AI, per this app''s own \"no AI for score\nmath\" rule. Postings >=70 are \"Top Fit\". Career''s Job Alerts card sorts\nbest-fit first and shows salary/matched skills; the single best untracked\nlead also feeds a new Dashboard Today''s Focus signal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c5454fe8f301370ff11ea8ec0bdd9e07cd61c69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/4c5454fe8f301370ff11ea8ec0bdd9e07cd61c69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/473e2336e5e10b385e8c15e9286c8eb490b23aac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g