s://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/15ae49a66d5f71121235b17995e721787a846af5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:31:44Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:31:44Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Label Today''s Algorithm Question; split Daily Mission''s coding item in 4\n\nDailyCodingCard had no section title, unlike the other three daily pick\ncards (Today''s Quiz/JS Function/UI Coding) - added \"Today''s Algorithm\nQuestion\" to match.\n\nDaily Mission''s single \"coding\" checklist item silently required *all*\nof today''s coding_daily_questions rows (algorithm + quiz + JS Function +\nUI Coding) to be completed via .every(), duplicating the separate quiz\nitem and never surfacing JS Function/UI Coding individually. Split into\nfour independent items, one per /coding card.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7d2e6db0a3c4622f62c4c0ef75d57e0fb7c7bfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/c7d2e6db0a3c4622f62c4c0ef75d57e0fb7c7bfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/15ae49a66d5f71121235b17995e721787a846af5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"