url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ed06a1a48f59fea5be681f9f448b45f764d6f07e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:06:23Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:06:23Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Fixed-split workout rotation; move Study Calendar into Learning''s right column\n\nWorkout planner picked categories uniformly at random with no memory of\nskips, so a repeatedly-skipped category (e.g. Back & Biceps) could stay\nunpicked for a long streak by pure chance. Replaced with a deterministic\n4-day fat-loss split (Chest & Triceps -> Back & Biceps -> Shoulders/Legs ->\nActive Recovery/Mobility & Recovery) that advances on skip too.\n\nAlso moved Learning''s Study Calendar from a standalone centered card into\nthe right column under By Category, matching the latest Claude Design pull.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1072377478880eea00dc7850abc92a072155eaa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/1072377478880eea00dc7850abc92a072155eaa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/ed06a1a48f59fea5be681f9f448b45f764d6f07e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https:/