thub.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/90ba4ec994f16aaf3d5449d83a2f09454e149c0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:51:25Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:51:25Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Fix calendar timezone bug; restyle Needs Attention per Claude Design\n\nCalendar bug: all four calendars (Coding/Learning/Health/Finance) built\neach cell''s date via .toISOString(), which converts to UTC first — for\nany timezone ahead of UTC (IST included) this silently shifted every\ndate back a day, landing \"today\"''s ring on the wrong weekday column.\nNow built directly from local y/m/d components, no UTC round-trip.\n\nNeeds Attention: replaced per-type icons/emoji with a uniform colored\ndot per row, and added a \"→ {action}\" suggestion line to risk and\nopportunity rows (Opportunity gained an `action` field split out from\nits one-sentence text) — matches the latest Claude Design pull.\nSignal rows intentionally keep their single line rather than inventing\nsuggestion text for 12 different signal generators.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"876d9a888636bba86b3cba9ac9b387f24536cdbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/876d9a888636bba86b3cba9ac9b387f24536cdbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/90ba4ec994f16aaf3d5449d83a2f09454e149c0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"ve