om/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/97aaa24e2aecd4608d06a811984384ab340f5d7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:48:38Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:48:38Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Add contribution-calendar widgets to Learning, Finance, and Health\n\nExtends the GitHub-style heatmap pattern already shipped for Coding''s\nContribution Calendar to three more pages, per the Claude Design source''s\nDashboard.dc.html project (which introduced this as a shared pattern\nacross all four).\n\n- Learning: Study Calendar, reads study_logs, Done/Missed, centered\n  standalone card below Resources/By Category.\n- Finance: Payment Calendar, real new Paid/Pending/Missed logic joining\n  recurring_expenses against expenses.recurring_expense_id (a real FK the\n  recurring-expenses cron already sets, previously untyped on Expense).\n  Paired side-by-side with Recurring Expenses.\n- Health: Workout Calendar, reads the workouts table, Done/Missed only --\n  no \"Rest\" status, since there''s no rest-day concept anywhere in the\n  data model to distinguish an intentional rest day from a missed one.\n  Paired side-by-side with the Workouts log.\n\nEach ships its own compute*Calendar() server function (status maps and\nper-day detail shapes differ enough per module that a shared generic\ncomponent wasn''t a clean fit) and a near-copy of CodingCalendar.tsx.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68053f3d0ed368c7390197f3b0ea0e82556e60fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/68053f3d0ed368c7390197f3b0ea0e82556e60fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/97aaa24e2aecd4608d06a811984384ab340f5d7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/97aaa24e2aecd4608d06a811984384ab340f5d7a","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDk3YWFhMjRlMmFlY2Q0NjA4ZDA2YTgxMTk4NDM4NGFiMzQwZjVkN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/f436d059603a528c7f4fa42c602793fd7eefe8e2","sha":"f436d059603a528c7f4fa42c602793fd7eefe8e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/f436d059603a528c7f4fa42c602793fd7eefe8e2"}],"sha":"97aaa24e2aecd4608d06a811984384ab340f5d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/97aaa24e2aecd4608d06a811984384ab340f5d7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/f436d059603a528c7f4fa42c602793fd7eefe8e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:20:02Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:20:02Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Make Telegram astrology bot + daily cron always reply in Hindi\n\ngetAstrologyReading()/getAstrologyCharacteristics() already had a lang\nparam driving real AI-generated Hindi content -- just needed to pass\n''hi''. Also fixes a real gap: the daily-reading flattening branch had\nhardcoded English connector words (\"Favorable for:\"/\"Avoid:\"/\"Mood:\")\nregardless of lang, even though that code path is exclusively used by\nthe Telegram bot/cron (the web page renders the same data through a\ndifferent, untouched function). Re-adds the panchang Hindi vocabulary\nto i18n/hi.ts (existed before, deleted when the web Panchang card was\nremoved) plus new TITHI_HI/YOGA_HI/KARANA_HI/CHOGHADIYA_NAME_HI/\nPAKSHA_HI maps for tithi/yoga/karana/Choghadiya value names.\n\nUnconditional, not a setting -- no per-user language preference exists\nanywhere (the web page''s own EN/हिं toggle is browser-local\nlocalStorage, unreachable server-side). Web page itself is unaffected,\nstill defaults to English -- verified none of the new dictionary keys\nare referenced by any t() call there, and the one function touched has\na completely separate code path for the web page''s own daily-reading\nrender.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54c518d63f2e5f79865375da34797bff132baaed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/54c518d63f2e5f79865375da34797bff132baaed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/f436d059603a528c7f4fa42c602793fd7eefe8e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://ap