n":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/4b074a6bdbe5a4f5da43594a01e258d12066e094/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T19:18:25Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T19:18:25Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Astrology: Chandrashtama, mood forecast, characteristics, structured daily reading, Choghadiya\n\nImplements the second astrology.md scope increase: Chandrashtama detection\nand a Moon-transit-grounded daily mood forecast; a one-time Characteristics\nprofile (new astrology_characteristics AI task, effectively-permanent cache);\nthe daily reading restructured into strict JSON (summary/favorableFor/avoid/\nmoodForecast, with remediation merged in from the existing curated table\nrather than AI-generated) instead of prose, while monthly/yearly stay prose;\nper-period dynamic AI Gateway cache TTLs (next IST midnight/month/year\nboundary) via a new askAI() per-call override; and Choghadiya day/night\ntime-blocks on the Panchang card.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c64a3e68ff8fdb09d55099f7c3a9630e4017d29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/8c64a3e68ff8fdb09d55099f7c3a9630e4017d29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/4b074a6bdbe5a4f5da43594a01e258d12066e094","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"ht