i.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/1d27b70ada6c460c3123874a9ef7421b0a217e9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:43:10Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:43:10Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Astrology: Panchang, Gochara, Navamsa, Dashboard strip, Telegram bot, Hindi toggle\n\nImplements astrology.md''s Part 3 scope increase in full: deterministic Panchang\nengine (tithi/nakshatra/yoga/karana/sunrise-sunset/kalam windows, global\npanchang_daily table), Gochara transit analysis feeding the AI reading''s\ncontext, the Navamsa (D9) divisional chart with a D1/D9 toggle on the natal\nchart card, a read-mostly Telegram bot + astrology-daily cron, a Dashboard\ndasha+panchang strip, and a localStorage-persisted EN/हिं toggle with native\nHindi AI generation and a parallel Hindi remedy table. The Outcome Journal item\nscoped earlier was dropped mid-build per explicit instruction and never shipped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e545fffd194fbb4705f2a7d9471dc2922bc34844","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/e545fffd194fbb4705f2a7d9471dc2922bc34844"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/1d27b70ada6c460c3123874a9ef7421b0a217e9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer"