"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/b9be53279aa66cff7f3eccaba158031550e4e930/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T15:36:47Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T15:36:47Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Fix Health score tip still listing sleep/water after their removal\n\ngetDashboardData()''s healthTip generator had its own separate hardcoded\n6-metric list and /6 divisor that survived the 2026-08-13 Sleep/Water\nremoval pass — the scoring math itself was fixed then, but this tip-text\ngenerator was a second, unnoticed copy of the same logic. Shows up in both\nExplain My Score and the Module Scores ring tooltip since they share\nscoreTips.health. Now reads the correct 4 fields with a /4 divisor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0902982cf9bc9f0829c53a7615d97bcbf03eee3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/a0902982cf9bc9f0829c53a7615d97bcbf03eee3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/b9be53279aa66cff7f3eccaba158031550e4e930","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserco