com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/7f2a8260f5ea6aa640c05bb76631b6b3642a825e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T15:30:06Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T15:30:06Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Add Astrology module: Vedic natal chart, Vimshottari + Yogini Dasha, daily/monthly/yearly readings, Remediation\n\nReal astronomical calculation via swisseph-wasm (Lahiri sidereal), never AI\nfor chart math -- AI only narrates already-computed positions/dasha state.\nEphemeris spike validated against the published Lahiri ayanamsa constant at\nJ2000.0. North Indian SVG kundli, Career-Profile-style compact birth details\ncard, and a curated (non-AI) remediation reference table matching the\nastrology.md spec''s anti-hallucination requirement. Nav lives in the profile\ndropdown per design review, not a top-level pill.\n\nFixed two real bugs found during implementation, not anticipated by the\nspec: Vercel''s file-tracer couldn''t discover swisseph-wasm''s runtime-loaded\n.wasm/.data files (outputFileTracingIncludes), and webpack broke the\npackage''s createRequire call (serverExternalPackages).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8bdd49a4086a4f9b73f3232aa8e275d355a8f0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vi