/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/7b7c3aa29ebbd854a2142d48e8fcd598075b5cec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T07:17:23Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T07:17:23Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Fix Learning streak resetting to 0 every morning before today''s session is logged\n\ngetStudyStreak() broke the streak the instant today wasn''t logged yet, unlike\nCoding''s identical currentStreak logic in daily-core.ts which explicitly\nallows today to stay pending without breaking the streak. Real data showed\nconsecutive logs on 2026-08-11/08-12 but the streak read 0 on 08-13 before\nthat day''s session was logged — now correctly reads 2, matching Coding''s\n\"today still open\" behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6e7c05014c496f241f4421142ffa04e853dab52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/a6e7c05014c