-typed as an array), evens out Health/Learning card heights, and syncs Finance/Career color and layout against the design spec.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe0c4c8542d15b389b1c6fa1beb158276b2a6e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/fe0c4c8542d15b389b1c6fa1beb158276b2a6e69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/80c7210286c0095a6cc41bac9fbc5d193620e8fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/80c7210286c0095a6cc41bac9fbc5d193620e8fe","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDgwYzcyMTAyODZjMDA5NWE2Y2M0MWJhYzlmYmM1ZDE5MzYyMGU4ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54","sha":"ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54"}],"sha":"80c7210286c0095a6cc41bac9fbc5d193620e8fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/80c7210286c0095a6cc41bac9fbc5d193620e8fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T09:26:54Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T09:26:54Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Add scroll caps to Planner''s task lists, codify exact-color-fidelity rule\n\nBump to v1.0.19 (deploy counter).\n\nToday''s Tasks and Overdue both gained the same max-h-[480px]/overflow-y-\nauto pattern already used on Applications and Job Alerts -- pulled from\nthe design source''s own change to the Today''s Tasks list, applied to\nOverdue too since it''s the same list component and a long backlog would\nhave the identical page-pushing problem.\n\nAlso added a standing instruction to CLAUDE.md: when implementing or\nreviewing against the Claude Design source, always pull the exact color\nvalue from its own CSS variables/inline styles rather than approximating\nwith a similar-looking Tailwind literal -- this session hit that gap\nmore than once (Career''s blue/purple status colors, QuickStats'' literal\ngreen-400 not matching the design''s darker --good in light theme).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c18e16a088200f752edad127c96795c843bc65a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/3c18e16a088200f752edad127c96795c843bc65a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKGZmNmM3NDUwYWQ2YzE3OWE4YjUxYzY4MjU1NzE4ZmI2MGQ3MzhlNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf","sha":"681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf"}],"sha":"ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ff6c7450ad6c179a8b51c68255718fb60d738e54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T09:08:36Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T09:08:36Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Restore whole-card Applications scroll, richer Modules stats, fix invisible hover tooltip\n\nBump to v1.0.18 (deploy counter).\n\nApplications cards: reverted the per-section scroll boxes back to a single\nwhole-card scroll (max 460px, everything scrolls together) per direct\nfeedback -- the design source''s granular per-section approach wasn''t what\nwas wanted here. Company Focus text sized down slightly.\n\nDashboard''s Modules grid tiles now show a second stat clause when there''s\na genuinely useful second fact already in the fetched data -- \"4 pending\n· 1 overdue\", \"Workout done · 8.2k steps\", \"12-day streak · today open\",\n\"2 in progress · 1 needs revision\" -- omitted when there''s nothing to add\n(0 overdue, no in-progress resources, etc). overdueCount and\nresourcesNeedingRevision added to getDashboardData()''s stats return,\nboth computed from data already being fetched, no new queries.\n\nModule Score rings'' hover tip was relying on a native title attribute,\nwhich meant it had no controllable styling and was effectively invisible\nagainst light theme''s background. Replaced with a proper styled tooltip\n(bg-surface-2 box, theme-aware text) shown on hover, matching the design\nreference directly. The truncated one-line tip underneath each ring stays\nas-is; the tooltip shows the same text in full.\n\nAlso: tightened the gap between TopNav and each page''s heading (pt-5 ->\npt-3 on the main content wrapper).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f98657480ce2b286ef6651680675363cc7d4a940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/f98657480ce2b286ef6651680675363cc7d4a940"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDY4MWRjN2Y2NDI2NjdkNTkwMTQ4ZjU4NmU0NDViZWE0NmJmYzJiZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990","sha":"bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990"}],"sha":"681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/681dc7f642667d590148f586e445bea46bfc2bdf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:59:59Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:59:59Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Applications cards: horizontal scroll, fixed width, per-section scroll boxes\n\nBump to v1.0.17 (deploy counter).\n\nPulled the design source again after the initial Career sync and found\nit had been updated to specify exactly this layout: the Applications\nlist scrolls horizontally instead of wrapping to a grid, each card is a\nfixed 260px wide, and instead of capping the whole card''s height, three\nindividual long-text sections (Job Description preview, Company Focus,\nInterview Guidance) each get their own small internal scrollbar (110px/\n90px/130px max-height) so one long section can''t blow out the card''s\nlayout. Job Alerts'' list also gained a 264px max-height with its own\nscroll. Matches the design source exactly rather than the two rounds of\nguessing (whole-card scroll, then clipped-no-scroll) that preceded it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af1f9b7737a7cdd24b1ec1fa56e870a9843d251b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/af1f9b7737a7cdd24b1ec1fa56e870a9843d251b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKGJjZWMyZDQxZGI2OTM0MmUzN2YzODQyODkxYzc3OGY5M2Y3Yjk5OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8","sha":"bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8"}],"sha":"bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/bcec2d41db69342e37f3842891c778f93f7b9990"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:34:08Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:34:08Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Sync design-token colors/spacing app-wide, pull Career''s latest design changes\n\nBump to v1.0.16 (deploy counter).\n\nColor/spacing consistency pass, re-verified against the live Dashboard.dc.html\ndesign source: Dashboard''s QuickStats now uses the design''s actual color\nlogic (streak stays neutral, budget remaining is a 3-tier %-based\ngood/warn/risk, workout status is warn/good instead of always neutral/green)\nplus its real padding/gap tokens (--card-pad-sm/--grid-gap-sm) instead of\nhardcoded values. Coding''s Practice Log difficulty pills, and the same\nflat-bg-plus-literal-text anti-pattern found on DailyCodingCard''s\nSolved/Pending badge, both switched to proper soft-bg chips. Six other\n\"half-fixed\" spots (soft-bg token already right, text still literal\nTailwind) brought into full consistency: Planner''s priority chips,\nLearning''s resource status badges, QuickAdd''s type buttons, Finance''s\nbudget-tier badges, Coding''s weak-area badges, and 3 of BotActivityCard''s\nmodule badges. Career''s application status colors corrected against the\ndesign''s actual mapping (applied/interview were blue/purple, neither used\nanywhere else in the app''s palette -- now neutral/accent per the design).\nLife Score hero and Module Scores cards moved off hardcoded padding onto\n--card-pad-lg. Dashboard''s Modules grid now uses the design''s fluid\nrepeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px,1fr)) instead of a fixed grid-cols-7 for 6\nitems, which fixes both the phantom empty column and the multi-row wrap\nat in-between viewport widths.\n\nLeft alone, confirmed intentional: Finance''s category colors and the\nDashboard/BotActivityCard per-module rainbow (Planner=blue, Learning=\npurple, Coding=cyan) -- the design source itself marks these as\n\"deliberately theme-invariant... do not convert to theme tokens.\"\n\nSeparately, pulled and implemented Career''s latest Applications changes\nfrom the design source: a Job Description preview box in the expanded\npanel, Required Skills chips recolored green (was neutral gray), missing-\nskills chips now shown inline next to the status dropdown too (not just\nexpanded), section labels got emoji prefixes, Job Alerts rows for an\nalready-applied company now show a green \"Applied\" badge instead of\nTrack, and screening/interview-stage applications default to expanded\n(tracked via a per-app override map so several can be open at once,\ninstead of the old single-expanded-row state). No migration needed --\njob_description already existed in the schema, just wasn''t surfaced yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e4b55ed82ff743f8923669c3ffd6873e4206958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/5e4b55ed82ff743f8923669c3ffd6873e4206958"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKGJkMGY4ODc1MmU2MGU4YjA0MzM3Zjc3MDgzYTI2ZmJmMmE1NjYyZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc","sha":"667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc"}],"sha":"bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/bd0f88752e60e8b04337f77083a26fbf2a5662d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:33:20Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:33:20Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Fix Today''s Quiz always-first-option bug, add question nav, sync design tokens\n\nToday''s Quiz: every one of the 50 hand-authored questions in\nTODAYS_QUIZ_BANK had correctIndex fixed at 0, making the correct answer\ntrivially the first option shown every time. Fixed with a deterministic\nhash+PRNG shuffle of each question''s options (seeded by date+question id,\nso a given day always reshuffles the same way -- preserves \"same day =\nsame quiz\" for both a reload and a Retake). Grading and the locked-in\nby-id attempt reconstruction both apply the same shuffle before checking\ncorrectIndex, so scoring always matches what was actually shown.\n\nAlso added question navigation: small Previous/Next arrows next to the\n\"n of 10\" counter let you move between questions without answering first\n-- an unanswered question just stays unlocked when revisited. The\nfull-width submit button still only appears once the current question is\nanswered.\n\nDesign-token sync pass, re-verified against the live Dashboard.dc.html\nsource (not stale local snapshots): light theme''s --good/--warn/--cyan\nhad all been darkened in the live design since the last sync (contrast\nreasons) and --warn-soft''s alpha was off by a hair in both themes -- all\ncorrected. Also brought in items from the design''s full token spec:\nLife Score hero number 44px->48px, Today''s Quiz nav arrows given the\nmissing border + correct 6px radius (now matches the app''s existing\ncalendar nav-button pattern), Contribution Calendar heatmap gap/radius\n4px/5px->3px/3px, and new --grid-gap/--grid-gap-sm tokens wired into\nall 11 card-to-card grid layouts app-wide.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd3000d9cd804a3238bee8447dfbd85e660c81f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/bd3000d9cd804a3238bee8447dfbd85e660c81f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDY2N2ZlMzVmZTZlZDUwMmQ3YTZlN2NjZjQzMDIxMTlhZmM5ZTEzZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/7c6560afa5220b4c72797d005c65b32c2a1e6887","sha":"7c6560afa5220b4c72797d005c65b32c2a1e6887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/7c6560afa5220b4c72797d005c65b32c2a1e6887"}],"sha":"667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/667fe35fe6ed502d7a6e7ccf4302119afc9e13fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/7c6560afa5220b4c72797d005c65b32c2a1e6887/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T18:09:15Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T18:09:15Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Fix light-theme WCAG contrast bug, close out backlog''s Dashboard design item\n\nTodaysInsight.tsx''s \"Confirmed pattern\" badge was the only live instance\nof --warn text on --surface-2 background (2.80:1, fails WCAG AA) --\nbackground changed to --warn-soft, matching the design source''s own fix\nfor this exact element (found via an earlier design-diff pass this\nsession). Audited --good/--cyan too (2.90:1 / 3.24:1 against\n--surface-2 in isolation -- same underlying issue) but neither is\nactually paired with bg-surface-2 anywhere in the app, so no second fix\nneeded.\n\nAlso fixed README''s stale \"Theme: dark-only\" claim -- both themes are\nlive (time-of-day default + manual override persisted in localStorage,\ntoggle in TopNav.tsx), not a hardcoded .dark class as previously\ndocumented.\n\nConfirmed the module/category color system \"bypassing theme tokens\" is\nintentional per the design source''s own code comment (\"Deliberately\ntheme-invariant... Do not convert to theme tokens\") -- no change made,\nnot a bug.\n\nThis closes out backlog.md''s last open \"Dashboard design\" item. Cross-\nchecked the rest of backlog.md against git log while here: 4 of its\nlisted items (JD missingSkills->Quiz, AI usage instrumentation, Goal\nEngine resolution, Company Insights framing) had already shipped earlier\nthis session under different task framing and the doc hadn''t caught up\n-- rewrote it to match reality (backlog.md itself intentionally stays\nuntracked, per established session convention).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"463b3dd63cc827deb3dee0f8d3632dd262ed9263","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/463b3dd63cc827deb3dee0f8d3632dd262ed9263"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re