mawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/4253ae7f31511de760b69b1fc5ebc92e5182a7b9","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDQyNTNhZTdmMzE1MTFkZTc2MGI2OWIxZmM1ZWJjOTJlNTE4MmE3Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/cfb431170dfbfd8856ac1a88084363f59472b1e4","sha":"cfb431170dfbfd8856ac1a88084363f59472b1e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/cfb431170dfbfd8856ac1a88084363f59472b1e4"}],"sha":"4253ae7f31511de760b69b1fc5ebc92e5182a7b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/4253ae7f31511de760b69b1fc5ebc92e5182a7b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/cfb431170dfbfd8856ac1a88084363f59472b1e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T16:46:17Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T16:46:17Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Adopt the design refresh''s ring glow, chip badges, chat role label, and trend labels\n\nThe Claude Design prototype was updated since the last check (confirmed\nvia diff against the previously-saved copy). Cross-checked every visual\nchange against current code and built the 4 that were genuinely new and\nworth adopting:\n\n- Life Score number: bigger/bolder with an accent->cyan gradient text\n  fill (ScoreHero.tsx). Its ring track itself is unchanged in the\n  design''s own diff -- only the number got the gradient treatment.\n- New --cyan / --ring-glow-strength tokens (globals.css, both themes,\n  light tuned much subtler than dark per the design''s own values).\n  Module Score mini-rings (MiniRing.tsx) get a glow in their own color;\n  the Health Score ring (HealthScoreHero.tsx) gets both a good->cyan\n  gradient and a glow, matching the design''s ringStyle() opts exactly.\n- Life Score Trend''s 3 reference lines gain dashed strokes + their\n  min/mid/max numeric labels (LifeScoreTrend.tsx) -- the lines already\n  existed, just without labels.\n- Ask Brain''s chat bubbles gain a \"Brain\" role label above assistant\n  replies (BrainChat.tsx).\n- Planner''s priority indicator and Career''s quiz-readiness badge move\n  from plain colored text to soft-bg chip pills (PlannerView.tsx,\n  career/types.ts + CareerView.tsx), reusing the same bg-*-soft pattern\n  already used for Finance/Learning pills elsewhere in the codebase.\n\nDeliberately NOT built: the design''s chat-bubble role label and\n\"Thinking...\" dot-pulse loader don''t structurally apply to Career\nMentor/Money Advisor/Code Mentor the way they do Ask Brain -- those are\nstill single-shot Q&A with no message history, not chat threads, so\nadding a role label there would require first building full chat\nhistory, a materially bigger feature not scoped here. The dot-pulse\nloader itself was skipped for Ask Brain too since the app already has\nits own polished shimmer-skeleton loading state, not a downgrade worth\nreplacing. Compact-density spacing tokens skipped as unreachable (no UI\ntoggle exists for compact density).\n\nVerified: tsc clean, build clean. Live-checked Dashboard, Health,\nPlanner, Career, and Ask Brain in both dark and light theme -- all\nrender correctly with zero console errors, including a real end-to-end\nAsk Brain question to confirm the role label renders on a live AI\nresponse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9573a824c84d772b1d14eab356fa604af5654ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/a9573a824c84d772b1d14eab356fa604af5654ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/cfb431170dfbfd8856ac1a88084363f59472b1e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api