m/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ae5450cfcf8f50f4ab78f99ae56fda0bfa52dfb3"}],"sha":"76291c00fb9ec6623c4abf353abaca0d41954339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/76291c00fb9ec6623c4abf353abaca0d41954339"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/ae5450cfcf8f50f4ab78f99ae56fda0bfa52dfb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:25:32Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:25:32Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Remove the Documents module entirely, per direct user request\n\nFull removal of code, data, and every cross-reference:\n\n- Deleted: src/app/documents/ (page/loading/error), src/features/documents/\n  (actions, types, DocumentsView.tsx), src/features/ai/doc-qa.ts,\n  src/features/telegram/modules/documents.ts\n- Nav: dropped the Documents link from ProfileMenu.tsx and TopNav.tsx''s\n  mobile \"More\" sheet\n- Ask Brain: dropped documents.count from BrainContext / getDashboardData /\n  buildContextSummary / the context prompt\n- Dashboard: dropped documentCount stat + its query, dropped the module\n  entry from BotActivityCard''s label map (Modules grid was already only\n  6 tiles in code -- README''s claim of 7 including Documents was already\n  stale before this change, fixed as part of this pass)\n- Settings: dropped documents from Data Export''s query/return and the\n  AI-task label map, updated the export description text\n- Telegram: dropped the module registration and TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN_DOCUMENTS\n  mapping from handler.ts\n- Shared infra: dropped ''documents'' from lib/signals.ts''s ModuleName type,\n  lib/telegram/buttons.ts''s UNDOABLE_TABLES, and doc_summary/doc_qa from\n  ai-gateway.ts''s AITask union + TASK_CONFIG\n\nDatabase: documents table dropped via migration (not left as orphaned\nschema like this session''s other removed-feature tables) -- 3 real rows\nexisted at removal time; user explicitly confirmed skipping the export-\nfirst safety step.\n\nREADME.md/CLAUDE.md: full Documents module section removed (kept the\nsection number rather than renumbering SS9-12, which are cross-referenced\nby number throughout), plus every cross-reference across Design System,\nTelegram capability table, AI feature files, Data Export, and UI\nReference sections. Also fixed two unrelated pre-existing stale claims\nnoticed along the way (Modules grid tile count, JetBrains Mono usage\nclaim referencing the old Sidebar).\n\nVerified: tsc clean, build clean, knip shows no new dead code. Live-\nchecked Dashboard (Modules grid, Bot Activity, Ask Brain panel), the\nProfileMenu dropdown (Documents link gone), /documents (404s correctly),\nand Settings (Export as JSON succeeds, no console errors) -- all touched\nsurfaces confirmed working with zero console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0369544d96700a9