s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/3223eaea3791874fae18dd9077184497a3454187/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:48:35Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:48:35Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Reframe Company Insights as \"Interview Guidance\" (backlog item 5)\n\nThe feature was already honest under the hood -- Claude has no web\nsearch, so it self-reports source: ''company-specific'' vs\n''general-fallback'' rather than fabricating company detail. But in\npractice it''s conservative and usually returns general-fallback, while\nthe section header (\"Company Insights\") and button (\"Load Company\nInsights\") implied company-specific intel by default. Renamed both to\n\"Interview Guidance\" / \"Load Interview Guidance\" so the default framing\ndoesn''t overpromise -- the source badge still tells the honest story\nonce it''s loaded. No logic/prompt change, display copy only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8606096f8abc94a859834cccf7d09ccb6ccf2584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/8606096f8abc94a859834cccf7d09ccb6ccf2584"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/3223eaea3791874fae18dd9077184497a3454187","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer