,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/11076992552b8d6f6e8f91c3635f36c4bf4fdffc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:37:26Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:37:26Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Rip out the Cross-Module Goal Engine entirely (backlog item 3)\n\nThe Goal Engine''s UI (GoalsCard, add/edit/delete) was already removed\n2026-08-10, leaving only read paths (getGoals, resolveAutoMetric,\ncheckGoalProgress, crossModuleGoals threading into Ask Brain) with no\nway to ever create a new goal -- a personal-backlog audit flagged this\nas silently half-alive. Decision: rip out the remaining code rather\nthan resurrect a minimal add-goal UI.\n\nRemoved: the whole src/features/goals/ directory; checkGoalProgress''s\nToday''s Focus signal in dashboard/actions.ts; crossModuleGoals from\nBrainContext/getDashboardData()/buildContextSummary/brain/prompts.ts;\nthe goalsContext parameter (and its prompt text) from\nrecommendQuizTopic (ai/quiz.ts) and recommendCodingQuestions\n(ai/coding-mentor.ts); the goals prop threaded through\ncoding/page.tsx -> CodingView.tsx; getGoals(''career'')/getGoals(''coding'')\ncalls in career/actions.ts and coding/recommendations.ts.\n\nThe goals table itself stays in place, unused, rather than migrated\naway -- same house style as the SIP columns and health_profile''s\ntarget_weight_kg/goal_deadline.\n\nVerified: tsc clean, build clean, knip shows no new dead code\nintroduced. Live-checked Dashboard (+ Ask Brain panel), Career, Coding,\nand Learning -- the four pages/features that read this data -- all load\nwith zero console errors after the removal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d26a5bf71a28c7bff878abf62b2bdbdc1bdf6fcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/d26a5bf71a28c7bff878abf62b2bdbdc1bdf6fcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/11076992552b8d6f6e8f91c3635f36c4bf4fdffc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/11076992552b8d6f6e8f91c3635f36c4bf4fdffc","node_id":"C_kwDOTKpqr9oAKDExMDc2OTkyNTUyYjhkNmY2ZThmOTFjMzYzNWYzNmM0YmY0ZmRmZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commit/10ea2c15ec58857f5d66bec7bda8f7908372a362","sha":"10ea2c15ec58857f5d66bec7bda8f7908372a362","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/10ea2c15ec58857f5d66bec7bda8f7908372a362"}],"sha":"11076992552b8d6f6e8f91c3635f36c4bf4fdffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/11076992552b8d6f6e8f91c3635f36c4bf4fdffc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/commits/10ea2c15ec58857f5d66bec7bda8f7908372a362/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:10:23Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T13:10:23Z","email":"vinaysomawat40@gmail.com","name":"vinaysomawat"},"message":"Add a cheap advisor/tab usage counter (backlog item 2)\n\nNew advisor_usage_log table + a fire-and-forget logAdvisorUsage()\n(src/lib/advisor-usage.ts) -- no scoring, just enough real data in 2-3\nweeks to decide which of Ask Brain''s 4 tabs, or which module advisor,\nactually get used, per the backlog.\n\n- AIAdvisorProvider''s shared toggle logs every advisor open (covers\n  Career Mentor, Code Mentor, Money Advisor, Health Coach, Study Coach,\n  Plan Coach, Ask Brain in one place).\n- Each multi-tab advisor''s own tab-click handler additionally logs the\n  tab (Money Advisor Ask/Simulate, Health Coach Recommendations/Weekly\n  Report, Study Coach Recommendations/Daily Plan, Ask Brain''s 4 tabs).\n- Executive Summary gets its own log call since it deliberately bypasses\n  AIAdvisorProvider (README''s noted exception).\n\nCaught in live verification: the first version called logAdvisorUsage\ninside setIsOpen''s functional updater, which is impure and threw\nReact''s \"Cannot update a component while rendering a different\ncomponent\" warning. Fixed by reading the pre-toggle isOpen/open value\nand logging before calling setState, not inside its updater. Verified\nagain after the fix -- clean console, correct rows written (advisor-only\nopen + tab-switch), test rows cleaned up afterward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1d8c2c355a7aa222d9d06e21d779bfd232a31cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/f1d8c2c355a7aa222d9d06e21d779bfd232a31cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/10ea2c15ec58857f5d66bec7bda8f7908372a362","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar