separator, tabs) -- scaffolded once, never used; the app\n  uses its own Card/Sidebar/etc. Trimmed tooltip.tsx to just\n  TooltipProvider, the only piece actually used (in layout.tsx)\n- goals/actions.ts: addGoal/updateGoalProgress/toggleGoalAchieved/\n  deleteGoal -- README already (inaccurately, until now) claimed these\n  were deleted when GoalsCard was removed 2026-08-10; only the component\n  was actually deleted, these were left behind\n- coding/daily-core.ts''s CODING_TOPICS (only ever used by a one-off\n  offline backfill script, not app code), finance/types.ts''s\n  INVESTMENT_COLOR, planner/actions.ts''s updatePriority (manual\n  priority-editing was removed from the UI)\n\nAlso dropped zustand, react-hook-form, class-variance-authority from\npackage.json -- each had zero usage left once the above files were gone.\nKept the shadcn devDependency for future scaffolding per direct request.\n\nRe-ran knip after all edits: no new dead code introduced, build/lint/\ntypecheck all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15697cf0633632394c56ef53eb6dbbc23e4e64d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/trees/15697cf0633632394c56ef53eb6dbbc23e4e64d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vinaysomawat/personal-ai-os/git/commits/ace75288f930f2547396d139a6cad17f0135b066","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30196269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinaysomawat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vinaysomawat","id":30196269,"login":"vinaysomawat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMTk2MjY5","organizations_url":"http