blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eb-Developer-Playground/bsh-mfe-demo/commits/060614f8f7cce4b1ac9f29ec2ca6573cee57effa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:32:43Z","email":"owenadira@gmail.com","name":"Owen Adirah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:32:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add docs folder to project structure tree (#2)\n\n* Docker infra, Makefile, and docs updates (#1)\n\n* feat(infra): add Docker infrastructure for multi-app MFE deployment\n\nMulti-stage Dockerfiles for host/explore/decide/checkout with:\n- pnpm workspace-aware builds with corepack pinning\n- nginx runtime with CORS headers, cache strategy, and SPA fallback\n- docker-compose for local development across all four apps\n- Docker-specific federation manifests using localhost port mapping\n- Runtime env.config.json injection via docker-entrypoint.sh\n- Branch-aware Azure Pipeline for targeted app builds\n- .dockerignore at repo root for efficient build context\n\n* feat(dev): add Makefile with Docker lifecycle and local dev commands\n\n* docs: update Docker, federation manifest, and dev workflow docs\n\n- README.md: fix federation manifest description (localhost ports, not service names)\n- docs/README.md: correct .dockerignore path reference\n- docs/architecture.md: align Dockerfile examples with actual Dockerfiles\n  (WORKDIR, corepack version pinning, nginx user, CORS headers, cache strategy)\n- docs/features.md: reflect actual feature boundaries\n\n* fix(docs) update tree with docs direcotry","tree":{"sha":"4acef3437f6a3d24ff94d129c034818cfa54ff62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eb-Developer-Playground/bsh-mfe-demo/git/trees/4acef3437f6a3d24ff94d129c034818cfa54ff62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eb-Developer-Playground/bsh-mfe-demo/git/commits/060614f8f7cce4b1ac9f29ec2ca6573cee57effa","verification":{"payload":"tree 4acef3437f6a3d24ff94d129c034818cfa54ff62\nparent d0c1e8958b540c93b5219cb6