E + ADR audit:\n- ADR-0001: noted the sixth project (ai-assistant) added after this ADR shipped\n- ADR-0002: amended - Cognito was cut (ADR-0007) before A.2 was ever built;\n  A.1/A.3 unaffected; Playwright reference was always stale (no e2e project exists)\n- ADR-0004: fixed the stale CommitSummarySlideOver mention (cut, see 76a8351);\n  corrected \"three tiers\" wording; pointed §5 at ADR-0007''s later role-gating\n- ADR-0006: ALLOWED_ORIGINS description updated for the env.js runtime-injection\n  it moved to; flagged the deleted module-registry.json as superseded\n- ADR-0007: corrected the false \"zero-redeploy property preserved\" claim -\n  module-registry.data.ts is a compiled TS module, not a JSON file the API\n  reads at runtime; added the third static origin (:4204) to the enumeration\n- ADR-0005: documented the previously-unreferenced Netlify env-injection\n  mechanism (packages/shell/write-env.mjs + two dashboard env vars)\n- README: scoped the *-prod-static launch-config claim to the 3 packages\n  that actually have one\n\nTwo decisions resolved:\n- ADR-0008 (new): formally cuts A.2''s mid-session refresh UX as\n  designed-not-built, closing the thread ADR-0002/0007 both left open\n  (\"sequenced next, not folded in\") with nothing ever built\n- ADR-0004: rxjs exact-match precaution downgraded from \"worth reproducing\n  before the CI gate ships\" to accepted as permanently unverified, no\n  reproduction planned - matched in the CI gate script''s own comment\n\nAlso fixes a stale class-name reference in ai-summary.service.ts''s docstring\n(AnthropicSummaryClient -> OllamaSummaryClient, left over from before the\npaid-API path was cut in favor of local Ollama).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f3cd032b67921e029513b7d04b4bf5c2b7b02d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/0f3cd032b67921e029513b7d04b4bf5c2b7b02d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/48753e01c7fa08f9d