0Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"chore: .env was never gitignored\n\nNoticed while verifying Docker locally this session - .env.example is the\ncommitted template, but the real .env (where a real ATLAS_DEV_JWT_SECRET\nor a non-localhost ATLAS_PUBLIC_HOST would eventually end up) had no\n.gitignore entry at all. No secret was ever actually committed - this\nsession''s own .env is just .env.example''s localhost defaults - but the\ngap was real and worth closing now that it''s been spotted, not left for\nwhoever adds a real secret first.","tree":{"sha":"6635afe2a2f85ef1de109654507cb833956dac89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/6635afe2a2f85ef1de109654507cb833956dac89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/cd7d1cf20dae2680c4c047eaae15624a13a1f4f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/cd7d1cf20dae2680c4c047eaae15624a13a1f4f5","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGNkN2QxY2YyMGRhZTI2ODBjNGMwNDdlYWFlMTU2MjRhMTNhMWY0ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c","sha":"8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c"}],"sha":"cd7d1cf20dae2680c4c047eaae15624a13a1f4f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/cd7d1cf20dae2680c4c047eaae15624a13a1f4f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:03:01Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:03:01Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"docs: Docker Compose is now verified end-to-end, not just build-verified\n\nDocker Desktop started working again on the dev machine - ran\ndocker compose build && up for real against all five services for the\nfirst time. Corrects README''s and ADR-0005''s \"never run via docker\ncompose up\" claims, which were accurate when written and are not\nanymore. New 2026-07-26 amendment covers what running it for real found\n(the nginx CORS-inheritance bug fixed in the previous commit) and what\nit confirmed (remote-admin''s SRI hash byte-identical to the Netlify\nbuild, Linux build environments agreeing with each other).","tree":{"sha":"88a556c02ffe513568d0b28a6c4194017f6b5649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/88a556c02ffe513568d0b28a6c4194017f6b5649"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDhmYzJiNGExYTNlMWE4ODk2ZWYyYTM1NGE5YTE1N2Y4YTE0ODAzOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6","sha":"067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6"}],"sha":"8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/8fc2b4a1a3e1a8896ef2a354a9a157f8a148039c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:01:33Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:01:33Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"fix(remote-admin): nginx dropped CORS header on the only path that needed it\n\nFound live running docker-compose for real, for the first time (2026-07-26,\nnow that Docker Desktop works again on this machine) - the CORS-mode fetch\n`loadRemoteEsm` uses only ever hits /remote-entry.js, and nginx does NOT\ninherit server-level `add_header` directives into a location block that\ndeclares its own `add_header` - it drops ALL inherited headers for that\nlocation, not just the duplicate one. The `/remote-entry.js` block already\nhad its own `add_header Cache-Control \"no-store\"`, which silently dropped\nthe server-level `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` exactly where it mattered.\n\nA CORS-mode fetch with no CORS headers on the response fails outright,\nbefore SRI is even evaluated - this would have made remote-admin\nunmountable under every real Docker Compose deploy, and nothing caught it\nuntil someone actually ran `docker compose up` against this Dockerfile for\nthe first time. Confirmed fixed live: remote-admin now mounts with real\ndata and \"SRI ✓\" (previously untestable \"SRI n/a\" placeholder never\napplied here - this is the genuine verified state).","tree":{"sha":"de9d6dcb1d2b2fa12039f9006709122a7ede2821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/de9d6dcb1d2b2fa12039f9006709122a7ede2821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDA2N2Q1MTk3NWYyZTMyOWZjMWMxZGUyZDhkOTIwYmY5ZjRiNmE0ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/5d9e8efa7428814e3b67b79ee89fe7cffc9da3f0","sha":"5d9e8efa7428814e3b67b79ee89fe7cffc9da3f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/5d9e8efa7428814e3b67b79ee89fe7cffc9da3f0"}],"sha":"067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/067d51975f2e329fc1c1de2d8d920bf9f4b6a4d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/5d9e8efa7428814e3b67b79ee89fe7cffc9da3f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T18:09:56Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T18:09:56Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(shell): build Screen 1 (Host shell/nav) - the spec''s missing first screen\n\nScreen 1 (docs/atlas-ui-implementation-spec.md) was specified to be built\nFIRST (\"everything mounts inside it\") but never actually landed - app.html\nwas still just a bare router-outlet + live-region. Found while trying to\nrecord a demo video: no way to navigate between Platform Health/Resource\nMonitoring/Team Admin except typing URLs directly.\n\nBuilt per spec: AppShell (CSS grid layout, relocated from App the\nrouter-outlet + §0.3 route-activation focus logic it now needs real chrome\naround), TopBar (Logo, Breadcrumb, EnvironmentPill, GlobalBuildIndicator,\nThemeToggle, AccountAvatar), SideNav (NavSection, NavItem with\nrouterLinkActive, RailCollapseToggle, ModulesLoadedPanel), RemoteVersionStrip,\nSkipLink.\n\nDeliberately NOT built, matching the spec''s own tiering: CommandPalette\n(spec: \"cut from scope\"), the Assembly popover on RemoteVersionStrip (spec:\n\"nice-to-have tier... defer if runway tightens\").\n\nReal findings along the way, not just plumbing:\n- SessionService.refresh() was never called anywhere outside its own tests -\n  nothing before AccountAvatar needed to know \"who is logged in\" (everything\n  else deliberately reads the already-role-filtered MODULE_REGISTRY instead).\n  Now called once in AppShell''s constructor.\n- RemoteVersionStrip''s status must follow REAL RemoteMountTelemetryService\n  data, not \"this is the current route''s remote\" - caught live against\n  remote-admin''s known dev-server SRI mismatch, where a naive version would\n  have claimed \"Mounted\" directly above a visible mount-failure fallback.\n  Fixed before it shipped; locked in with a test.\n- TopBar/SideNav''s grid-positioned inner elements weren''t actually\n  participating in AppShell''s CSS grid, because grid-column/grid-row on a\n  child component''s internal markup doesn''t reach through to how the CUSTOM\n  ELEMENT itself is positioned by its parent''s grid. Fixed with\n  `:host { display: contents }` on both.\n- Removed the login screen''s own logo (redundant now that TopBar always\n  renders one on every route, login included) and switched its centering\n  from 100dvh to 100% now that it renders inside AppShell''s <main>, not a\n  bare full-page container.\n\nModulesLoadedPanel''s live-dot and GlobalBuildIndicator''s module count are\nboth real signals already available client-side (RemoteMountTelemetryService,\nMODULE_REGISTRY) - no new fetches, no fabricated data. Team Admin''s nav\nlink only renders when remote-admin is actually present in the (already\nrole-filtered server-side) registry, extending the same \"an unauthorized\nbrowser never even requests a bundle it can''t load\" property authGuard\nalready enforces for direct navigation.\n\n87/87 shell tests pass; production build clean; verified live end-to-end\n(anonymous empty state, admin login, nav between all three routes, role-\ngating, RemoteVersionStrip''s real telemetry, the fixed false-\"Mounted\"\ncase).","tree":{"sha":"8a557a8cbb8e419a5c818ab2309c43d095eccf45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/8a557a8cbb8e419a5c818ab2309c43d095eccf45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/5d9e8efa7428814e3b67b79ee89fe7cffc9da3f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":fal