tps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/a448b897e5c978e96156d240b2f2f1836ee66d8a","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGE0NDhiODk3ZTVjOTc4ZTk2MTU2ZDI0MGIyZjJmMTgzNmVlNjZkOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/dfc7d83355c472a57cfb1d5e1702794a9321102d","sha":"dfc7d83355c472a57cfb1d5e1702794a9321102d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/dfc7d83355c472a57cfb1d5e1702794a9321102d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c","sha":"41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c"}],"sha":"a448b897e5c978e96156d240b2f2f1836ee66d8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/a448b897e5c978e96156d240b2f2f1836ee66d8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:22:15Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:22:15Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"fix(shell): dev-login screen leaked ADR text to users, shared loading state across both buttons\n\nTwo real UX bugs, both in the one screen every visitor sees first:\n\n1. The subtitle literally read \"Dev IdP stub (ADR-0007) — pick a role\" -\n   an internal architecture citation, not user-facing copy. Rewritten to\n   just say what it is: a demo environment, no account needed.\n2. `pending` was one shared boolean driving both buttons'' label -\n   clicking \"Continue as Admin\" flipped BOTH buttons to \"Signing in...\".\n   Replaced with `pendingRole: AtlasRole | null`, so only the button\n   actually clicked shows the in-flight label; the other stays disabled\n   (still prevents a second concurrent login) but keeps its own real\n   label instead of falsely claiming it''s the one working. New spec\n   locks this in.\n\nAlso added a small inline Atlas logomark (three connected nodes -\nthe federation-of-remotes shape, in the design system''s accent color)\nplus a wordmark, gave Admin/Viewer visual hierarchy via the existing\nButton variants (default/ghost, no new component needed), and fixed\nthe card not actually centering on real viewport heights - min-height:\n100dvh plus padding without box-sizing: border-box was adding the\npadding on top of the full viewport height rather than within it,\npushing the card below center. Verified live via getBoundingClientRect()\nat 1280x800: card center now lands exactly on viewport center.","tree":{"sha":"5acc632528368b63d22972c4596488ed3652d451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/5acc632528368b63d22972c4596488ed3652d451"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDQxYmMxOWRlY2Q5MGQ3OGYzZmQ2NGZjOTNjNjAyMWVjZDQyYjg1N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/5421bcf82b8e1e5da2450b068b06996fca123239","sha":"5421bcf82b8e1e5da2450b068b06996fca123239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/5421bcf82b8e1e5da2450b068b06996fca123239"}],"sha":"41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/41bc19decd90d78f3fd64fc93c6021ecd42b857c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/5421bcf82b8e1e5da2450b068b06996fca123239/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:09:28Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:09:28Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"docs(readme): add demo GIF\n\nRecorded against the live deployment (Netlify + Render), not staged\nlocally - dev-IdP login through Platform Health with all three remotes\nmounted, Resource Monitoring, and Team Admin. The ai-assistant card''s\n\"Summary unavailable\" state in the recording is the real, expected\n503 (no Ollama in the public deploy per ADR-0005''s amendment), not a\ncapture artifact.\n\n.gitattributes marks *.gif binary so git never tries to text-normalize\nor line-ending-convert it, same reasoning as the existing *.sh/*.conf\nrules just for a format where that would corrupt the file outright\nrather than just misformat it.","tree":{"sha":"e352df8a5c45b472ac9549d5c9ad2a253acd4517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/e352df8a5c45b472ac9549d5c9ad2a253acd4517"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/5421bcf82b8e1e5da2450b068b06996fca123239","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/5421bcf82b8e1e5da2450b068b06996fca123239","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDU0MjFiY2Y4MmI4ZTFlNWRhMjQ1MGIwNjhiMDY5OTZmY2ExMjMyMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/aa9359953a9e6d0c750b3f4823c353d68fe8a81d","sha":"aa9359953a9e6d0c750b3f4823c353d68fe8a81d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/aa9359953a9e6d0c750b3f4823c353d68fe8a81d"}],"sha":"5421bcf82b8e1e5da2450b068b06996fca123239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adit