T17:30:40Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"docs(adr): amend ADR-0005 with the real deploy - Docker Desktop failure, Netlify+Render pivot, three live bugs\n\nDocker Desktop turned out structurally broken on the dev machine (confirmed\nby reproducing the identical failure twice after clearing socket state\nfresh each time, not a stale-cache guess). The live deploy ended up on\nNetlify (four frontends, build-from-source) + Render (api, Docker-built\nserver-side) instead of a local docker compose up - the boundary''s\nreasoning in this ADR held, only the mechanism changed. Records the three\nreal bugs only deploying surfaced (Nx-pruned lockfile inconsistency, SRI\nhash drift across build machines, SameSite=Lax cookies dropped cross-site),\nthe ai-assistant/Ollama public-deploy decision, and the DeployHistoryService\ngit-log gap as a named, unfixed follow-up.","tree":{"sha":"afa7ac7f8d201cc9c9905e94fa21bf0a37a1d3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/afa7ac7f8d201cc9c9905e94fa21bf0a37a1d3de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/9e147b000bab418f05e68db7df9b5d172bcbdf2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a