tps://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/d09685dc158b44f302d1db7e6b623f011abf6e1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:04:52Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:04:52Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"fix(api): auth cookies never survived cross-site deploy (SameSite=Lax)\n\nFound live on the real deploy (2026-07-20): shell (atlas-adithi-shell.\nnetlify.app) and api (atlas-eebz.onrender.com) are different registrable\ndomains, not just different ports like local dev''s localhost:5500 vs\nlocalhost:3000. SameSite=Lax cookies are never attached to cross-site\nfetch() calls (only top-level navigations) - login''s POST returned 200\nand the response carried Set-Cookie, but the browser silently declined to\nstore/send it on every subsequent request, so the shell read as\npermanently anonymous despite a \"successful\" login. The original comment\non this file predicted the shape of this gap but the code never actually\nbranched on it.\n\nATLAS_CROSS_SITE_COOKIES=true switches both cookies to SameSite=None;\nSecure (coupled - None requires Secure, which requires HTTPS, which both\nNetlify and Render provide). Local dev and same-host Compose deploys are\nunaffected - the env var defaults unset, keeping the existing Lax\nbehavior that''s actually correct there.","tree":{"sha":"7482b3a81e67