hes against the real deployed Netlify builds\n\nConfirmed live, not assumed: fetched all three remotes'' actual entry\nfiles from their deployed atlas-adithi-*.netlify.app URLs and hashed\nthem - none of the three matched the locally-built hashes committed\nearlier, despite .nvmrc pinning Node 22 to try to make the build\nreproducible. Determinism across a different build machine was flagged\nas unverified in the write-env.mjs commit; this is that verification,\nand it came back negative.\n\nremote-admin''s mismatch is the one that actually breaks something:\nload-remote-esm.ts''s fetch(url, { integrity }) enforces this hash for\nreal (ADR-0006 Decision 4), so the stale value would have made Team Admin\nfail to mount in production with \"Failed to fetch,\" the exact class of\nbug ADR-0006''s own amendment already found once. remote-monitoring/\nai-assistant''s hashes are unenforced for type: federation, but corrected\ntoo for the same audit-trail-should-be-true reason as the earlier fix\nthis session.","tree":{"sha":"82f9892361aa33af00c792a0f0669c8f347b6c9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/82f9892361aa33af00c792a0f0669c8f347b6c9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/3f1f7f77b600da8f746deb2284907dd4da5c6b06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/receiv