sers/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/7a36bf0d90219e8c221b7175ab2d23b8f5297537/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:41:39Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:41:39Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"test(remote-monitoring): cover the locked no-flat-zero and never-color-alone rules\n\nTimeSeriesPanel: zero points in range renders \"No data in the selected\nrange.\" and no chart element - never a flat baseline at 0, which would\nimply measurements that never happened (Appendix A.5). Also covers the\nsr-only latest/min/max summary once real points exist.\n\nStatPanel: null value renders an em dash, never \"0\" (same A.5 rule for\nbig-number panels); the caution threshold always pairs a visible icon\nwith an sr-only \"Warning\", never color alone.\n\njsdom has no real <canvas> context or ResizeObserver, so echarts is\nmocked and a minimal ResizeObserver stub is installed for the one test\nthat mounts EChartsCanvas - real chart rendering is already verified in\nan actual browser (theme switching, resize, empty-state), this just\nlocks in the Angular-level contract so it can''t silently regress.","tree":{"sha":"31608fe8fd4cbf39666de1c54982344d7eea41ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/31608fe8fd4cbf39666de1c54982344d7eea41ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/7a36bf0d90219e8c221b7175ab2d23b8f5297537","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/7a36bf0d90219e8c221b7175ab2d23b8f5297537","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDdhMzZiZjBkOTAyMTllOGMyMjFiNzE3NWFiMmQyM2I4ZjUyOTc1Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8","sha":"eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8"}],"sha":"7a36bf0d90219e8c221b7175ab2d23b8f5297537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/7a36bf0d90219e8c221b7175ab2d23b8f5297537"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:41:24Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:41:24Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(remote-monitoring): build Screen 3 Resource Monitoring screen\n\nResourceMonitoringView (remote root) + MonitoringToolbar (time range,\nservice filter, auto-refresh) + PanelGrid + TimeSeriesPanel x2 (CPU,\nMemory) + StatPanel x2 (running services, API uptime), wired to the new\n/api/monitoring/resources endpoint. Replaces the placeholder App scaffold\nentirely - ResourceMonitoringView is now the federation-exposed root.\n\nToolbar vocabulary is the kind-era spec resolved to reality: cluster\nfilter cut (no referent on one dev host), namespace filter became a real\nservice filter over the four dev-mode processes, \"restarts\" became API\nuptime (no supervisor exists to track real restarts, and inventing one\njust to fill the slot would be exactly the fabricated-telemetry pattern\nthe project forbids).\n\nEChartsThemeBridge (resolveChartTokens + watchChartTheme) rebuilds each\nchart''s option on every <html data-theme> flip, reusing the existing\nDOM theme channel''s MutationObserver rather than a second one. Charts\nrender through a hand-rolled EChartsCanvas wrapper, not ngx-echarts:\nthat package''s outputFromObservable() throws NG0203 under this\nAngular/zoneless setup, reproduced identically standalone (no\nfederation involved), so it''s a genuine upstream incompatibility, not\nthis project''s bug - and ResizeObserver-driven resize was going to be\nhand-rolled either way per spec.\n\nLocked a11y rules, both real: Appendix A.5''s no-data-in-range never\nrenders a flat-zero line (TimeSeriesPanel shows text instead), and\nStatPanel''s caution threshold is never color-alone (icon + sr-only\n\"Warning\" pairs with the color change).\n\nMonitoringDataService and provideEchartsCore are both provided at the\ncomponent level, not root/app-config: a federated remote''s own\napp.config.ts only applies to its standalone dev-preview bootstrap,\nnever to AngularRemoteBoundary''s createComponent() path (reproduced\nlive as NG0201 while wiring this up) - and a root-scoped poller would\nkeep running after the user navigates away from /monitoring.","tree":{"sha":"2644b4a91a10df7a1deb0428fa3b17c86d01dd68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/2644b4a91a10df7a1deb0428fa3b17c86d01dd68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGViMjA1ZDViZGM2ZTFmOGUyZDgzYjZjM2E0NjdjZWZiMDg2Y2Q0ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415","sha":"006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415"}],"sha":"eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/eb205d5bdc6e1f8e2d83b6c3a467cefb086cd4e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:40:55Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:40:55Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(api): add real resource-metrics endpoint for Resource Monitoring\n\nGET /api/monitoring/resources - real host CPU (delta-based os.cpus()\nsampling, same technique OS monitoring tools use) and memory usage on a\nbounded in-memory rolling buffer, real reachability checks against the\nfour dev-mode services (api/shell/remote-monitoring/remote-admin), and\nreal process.uptime() for the API process. No fabricated telemetry\n(spec §0.5f) and no new infra, since Docker Compose isn''t built yet.\n\nJwtCookieGuard only, no RolesGuard - remote-monitoring is admin+viewer\nper module-registry.data.ts, so authentication alone is the correct gate.","tree":{"sha":"39413974b1aaed6b6d4af101feb11b60bcb6045d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/39413974b1aaed6b6d4af101feb11b60bcb6045d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDAwNmQyMzUzYjNjNzdlY2EwYzgzMDkxOTI4NmQwMzI2MzQ2NTg0MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b","sha":"b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b"}],"sha":"006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/006d2353b3c77eca0c830919286d032634658415"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:40:38Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:40:38Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"docs(schedule): resolve stale kind/k8s references, flag RemoteIdentity gap\n\nADR-0005 already cut Kubernetes entirely, but docs/day-by-day-schedule.md''s\nDay 4 still said \"real local kind cluster metrics\" and Day 12 still listed\nkind/Helm/ArgoCD as a task to pick up. Records the actual resolution: real\nOS/process metrics (no Docker Compose exists yet either, so that''s not the\nreal data source right now) and Day 12 as already answered by ADR-0005.\n\nAlso flags that RemoteIdentity (host-owned per its own doc comment, per\n§0.5e belongs on Screen 2''s ModuleHealthCard) doesn''t belong on Resource\nMonitoring''s own header the way the spec literally says - written down now\nso Day 10 doesn''t have to rediscover it.","tree":{"sha":"3e77ba1c11cf553527ad1230b0d6779cfac131bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/3e77ba1c11cf553527ad1230b0d6779cfac131bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGIyMWZmMWI4MTBjNjFiNTkyYzA1NDZlODM4Mzc1ZmE3ODRkYTE4MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d","sha":"21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d"}],"sha":"b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/b21ff1b810c61b592c0546e838375fa784da182b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T12:06:37Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T12:06:37Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"fix(shell): use the app- selector prefix on RemoteIdentity/FrameworkMark\n\nCI''s shell:eslint:lint failed (2 errors): both components used an\natlas- prefix, but @angular-eslint/component-selector requires app-,\nmatching every other component in this project (app-root,\napp-dev-login-screen, app-remote-mount-host, etc.). No behavior change.\n\nRan the exact CI command locally (npm run nx -- run-many -t eslint:lint\ntest build) before pushing — all 5 projects pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88be4c46c362f3dd53267714de2fadd459a01363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/88be4c46c362f3dd53267714de2fadd459a01363"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDIxNzA3ODEyOTc0YTUzZWZlYzZmMDMxYjg5MTA4ZWM4MTkwZjlkMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead","sha":"c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead"}],"sha":"21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/21707812974a53efec6f031b89108ec8190f9d1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:46:29Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:46:29Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(shell): add RemoteIdentity + framework marks (§0.5e signature primitive)\n\nFull variant only — the shape consistent across the spec''s ASCII example\nand the ModuleHealthCard / RemoteVersionStrip / ResourceMonitoringView-\nheader / Assembly-panel mockups:\n\n  [△ Angular]  resource-monitoring@21.2.18   federation · SRI n/a\n   ● healthy    mounted 183ms · 341 KB · 17 shared\n\nHost-owned, Angular-only, no React twin: §0.5e is explicit that \"a remote\nnever draws another remote''s identity,\" so this never crosses the\nfederation boundary and carries none of §0.2''s cross-framework parity\nburden. Composed from the six locked components (Badge, StatusDot) plus a\nnew framework-marks inline-SVG set (§0.5e — explicitly not a DS Icon, so it\ndoesn''t reopen the six-component lock). Purely presentational: every field\nis an input, nothing is fetched here, and it doesn''t import\nModuleRegistryEntry''s type — decoupling the identity display from the\nregistry schema.\n\ntransport→badge-tone mapping (federation→info/blue, esm→accent/magenta) is\nconfirmed against the mockup screenshots, not invented.\n\nDeliberately NOT built: the compact ModulesLoadedPanel row (mark +\nname@version + a live-dot, no transport badge or provenance line) is a\ngenuinely different arrangement, not a smaller version of this one —\ndeferred until ModulesLoadedPanel itself is built rather than guessing its\nshape now and likely redesigning this component''s API later.\n\nVerified in a real browser (not checked in — same static-harness pattern as\nthe design-system session): rendered real TestBed output for all three\nframeworks (angular/react/ai) x both themes, confirmed every token-driven\nvalue (transport badge colors, status dot colors, mono font, decorative+\nlabelled framework marks) resolves correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5caaf7b9f7a9ead97959a176d4b729f3c6ebf01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/f5caaf7b9f7a9ead97959a176d4b729f3c6ebf01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGMzMmRiYzk4MmUyZDE1MGM2YTEwNjVhOTE1ZWJhOGUwMTM1NDJlYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624","sha":"49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624"}],"sha":"c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c32dbc982e2d150c6a1065a915eba8e013542ead"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:42:05Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:42:05Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"docs(adr): add ADR-0007 - dev IdP stub and role-gated remote loading\n\nResolves the role-gating half of the resume bullet ADR-0004 rewrote, and\nAppendix A.2''s now-superseded Cognito 401-refresh sequence. Covers: the dev\nIdP stub and its exact two-file swap seam to a real IdP; why server-side\nfiltering at the registry endpoint beats nav-hiding, client-side filtering,\nand mount-time checks (a trust boundary that lives on the side the\nadversary controls isn''t a boundary); and the honest residual - gating\nreduces attack surface, the API enforcing role on every data call is the\nreal backstop, and the bundle was verified (not assumed) to contain no\nsecrets worth protecting.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b18c0118fbcd1b35858ffcd7d0bd3fbeda0c4b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/b18c0118fbcd1b35858ffcd7d0bd3fbeda0c4b5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDQ5YzNlOGZiMWYwMWY2YWJjNWM0NzU4MzUwYWY4YTE5NTUwNTc2MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb","sha":"e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb"}],"sha":"49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/49c3e8fb1f01f6abc5c4758350af8a1955057624"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:41:54Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:41:54Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(shell): route guard checks registry membership; add dev login screen\n\nADR-0007 Decisions 1 & 2/4. authGuard no longer stubs to () => true - it\nasks exactly one question, \"is this route''s remoteName present in the\ninjected MODULE_REGISTRY?\", and redirects to /login (a UrlTree, not a bare\nfalse 404) when it''s absent. No role check happens here or anywhere else\nin the shell: MODULE_REGISTRY was already filtered server-side by the\nprevious commit, so the guard and RemoteMountHost/AngularRemoteBoundary\nread the same one array and cannot disagree.\n\nSessionService is the shell''s one source of \"who is logged in, with what\nrole\" - deliberately thin (login/session/logout only, no token handling)\nand deliberately NOT consulted by the guard or mount path, so there is\nexactly one place a role check happens and it isn''t here. DevLoginScreen is\nthe dev IdP stub''s entire login UI and the one piece a real IdP swap\nreplaces wholesale.\n\nVerified live: an anonymous load redirects '''' -> monitoring -> /login (zero\nremote fetches en route); logging in as viewer or admin reloads the shell\nso the freshly-gated registry takes effect, since MODULE_REGISTRY is a\nstatic, pre-bootstrap DI value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf813c5a52eba0c2fec9c0dd87bdcf23ee7d007a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/bf813c5a52eba0c2fec9c0dd87bdcf23ee7d007a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGU5ZDZiYWJjMzcyZmQ1ZjM0MTI3MGU1ODk3M2U0ZWFhNDIyMWRmZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2","sha":"18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2"}],"sha":"e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/e9d6babc372fd5f341270e58973e4eaa4221dfeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:40:08Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:40:08Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(api,shell): role-gate the module registry at the API, not the client\n\nADR-0007 Decision 2. GET /api/module-registry filters entries by the\ncaller''s JWT role claim server-side (MODULE_REGISTRY_SOURCE gains\nallowedRoles) before anything reaches the shell - an unauthenticated or\nunder-privileged caller never receives an entry it may not load, so there\nis nothing on the client side to un-filter. packages/shell/public/\nmodule-registry.json is deleted: a client-servable copy of the same data\nwould be exactly the two-sources-of-truth divergence bug ADR-0006 already\nfixed once, one layer earlier.\n\nloadModuleRegistry() now fetches the gated endpoint with credentials:\n''include'' instead of the old static asset; everything downstream of that\nfetch (per-entry parsing, the origin allow-list, SRI) is unchanged.\n\nadmin-data/ ships alongside as ADR-0007 Decision 3''s verification backstop\n- a @Roles(''admin'') endpoint that exists solely to prove \"the API is the\nreal authorization boundary, not the loading gate\" is a demonstrated fact,\nnot a design claim. auth-flow.integration.spec.ts exercises the full\ncookie-based flow through real HTTP (supertest), including the case that\nmatters most: a viewer''s live session cookie 403s the admin data endpoint\ncalled directly, bypassing the loading gate entirely.\n\nVerified live (four real servers, real network, four roles/paths): as\nviewer, zero requests to :4202 anywhere, including navigating straight to\n/admin; as admin, both remotes fetch and mount cleanly. A synthetic\nadmin-only federation entry (reverted before this commit) confirmed the\nfederation half too - initFederation() never fetches an entry the registry\nwithheld, and does fetch it once role permits, closing the adversarial\ncase for both transports (ESM was already covered by the existing SRI\ntamper/allow-list tests from ADR-0006).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40528bc2b4a5a003813ee8f060357cdea25b60ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/40528bc2b4a5a003813ee8f060357cdea25b60ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDE4NjU4MjAwZDdkNTQ3OWZkNTgyYWRhYzc3MzQwZDk5YzJkYzMxZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685","sha":"5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685"}],"sha":"18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/18658200d7d5479fd582adac77340d99c2dc31e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:38:40Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:38:40Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(api): add dev IdP stub - role-claimed JWT auth via HttpOnly cookies\n\nADR-0007 Decision 1. POST /auth/login picks a role (no password - there''s\nno real user directory behind this) and issues an HS256 access+refresh JWT\npair as HttpOnly cookies; the UI''s entire vocabulary is login/session/\nlogout, never token bytes. JwtCookieGuard/RolesGuard are the enforcement\nprimitives the next commit''s registry gate and this commit''s own\nverification backstop both build on.\n\nAlso: cookie-parser + scoped CORS in main.ts, an `api` launch config entry,\nand @nestjs/jwt/cookie-parser/supertest (+ types) as deps - supertest backs\nthe integration suite landing with the next commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82fecc9cfc0d121d071aeb63bbe038ff93be52e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/82fecc9cfc0d121d071aeb63bbe038ff93be52e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDVmOTU0NjE4N2ZhYzIxYmY3ZDA1OWUyYTNhZTg0ODQ5ZTAyNjk2ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/183ebe21174c3a94ce84f6b75477a55e4be86829","sha":"183ebe21174c3a94ce84f6b75477a55e4be86829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/183ebe21174c3a94ce84f6b75477a55e4be86829"}],"sha":"5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/5f9546187fac21bf7d059e2a3ae84849e0269685"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/183ebe21174c3a94ce84f6b75477a55e4be86829/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:28:26Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:28:26Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(design-system): implement §0.5 federation visual language additions\n\nThe spec picked up a new §0.5 (federation visual language) plus linked\nmockups since the six-component pass. Cross-referenced the mockup\nscreenshots against the written spec and implemented what''s concretely\nactionable at the design-system layer (screens/RemoteIdentity composition\nare later work):\n\n- tokens.css: add --surface-hairline, --ease-out, --dur-1/2/3 (additive per\n  §0.5, no existing token changed). --surface-hairline mixes toward white\n  rather than --text so it lightens in both themes (mixing toward --text\n  would darken in light mode, the wrong direction for a highlight). Not yet\n  consumed by any of the six components — it''s for --surface-raised\n  elements (popovers/drawers/mount frame), none of which exist yet.\n\n- Badge: new `info` tone, mapping to the existing --info token. Confirmed\n  via mockups: the \"Native Federation\" transport badge and the \"LOADING\"\n  AiDeploySummary state badge are both blue, which wasn''t any of Badge''s\n  existing tones.\n\n- StatusDot: new `live` tone (--accent) plus a `pulse` boolean, reduced-\n  motion aware. Distinct from health status — this is §0.5d''s \"one loud\n  moment,\" the magenta live-indicator on ModulesLoadedPanel, independent of\n  a remote''s health color (health dots stay green/amber/red/gray and are\n  never pulsed).\n\n- Button: transition moves off hardcoded 0.15s ease onto var(--dur-1)\n  var(--ease-out), plus a prefers-reduced-motion guard — §0.5b explicitly\n  calls for \"extend[ing] the guard Skeleton already ships to every\n  transition.\"\n\nExtended parity.spec.ts to cover all of the above, including a real bug it\ncaught before commit: adding a second/third `@media (prefers-reduced-\nmotion: reduce)` block to the shared design-system.css broke\nextractBraceBlock''s naive indexOf lookup (it would silently grab whichever\ncomponent''s block happened to come first in the file). Fixed by adding an\noptional fromIndex, anchored on each component''s own unique preceding\nselector.\n\nVerified in a real browser (not checked in — see prior session''s harness\npattern): new tokens resolve to valid values, Badge info/StatusDot live-\npulse/Button transition all render identically between Angular and React.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"493d53e0d60aaaec01c0a8a826aa8ed426db3215","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/493d53e0d60aaaec01c0a8a826aa8ed426db3215"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/183ebe21174c3a94ce84f6b75477a55e4be86829","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/183ebe21174c3a94ce84f6b75477a55e4be86829","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDE4M2ViZTIxMTc0YzNhOTRjZTg0ZjZiNzU0NzdhNTVlNGJlODY4Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/53c04f53b26ccfdf0c47dc6baa7c57ce0de46221","sha":"53c04f53b26ccfdf0c47dc6baa7c57ce0de46221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/53c04f53b26ccfdf0c47dc6baa7c57ce0de46221"}],"sha":"183ebe21174c3a94ce84f6b75477a55e4be86829","url":"https://api.github.com/rep