s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/d91381093d7f3e21f6f304970730f42559c8b953/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T07:23:51Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T07:23:51Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"fix(design-system): declare @angular/common peer dep, drop unused @lucide/angular\n\n@nx/dependency-checks caught this in CI (never run against these commits\nuntil now, since the branch was pushed for the first time this session):\nicon.ts imports NgComponentOutlet from @angular/common but it wasn''t\ndeclared anywhere in package.json, and @lucide/angular was declared but\nnever actually imported - icon.ts only mentions it in a doc comment.","tree":{"sha":"dcdd71ba9b6c0032c3fa3839285e6c8ad217d2b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/dcdd71ba9b6c0032c3fa3839285e6c8ad217d2b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/d91381093d7f3e21f6f304970730f42559c8b953","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/d91381093d7f3e21f6f304970730f42559c8b953","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGQ5MTM4MTA5M2Q3ZjNlMjFmNmYzMDQ5NzA3MzBmNDI1NTljOGI5NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/db52290bbf9c702a0d25c226db704da24b601458","sha":"db52290bbf9c702a0d25c226db704da24b601458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/db52290bbf9c702a0d25c226db704da24b601458"}],"sha":"d91381093d7f3e21f6f304970730f42559c8b953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/d91381093d7f3e21f6f304970730f42559c8b953"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/db52290bbf9c702a0d25c226db704da24b601458/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T07:06:44Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T07:06:44Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"test(design-system): guard Angular/React CSS parity across all six DS components\n\nAngular ships each component''s rules as view-encapsulated inline styles;\nReact ships the same rules as global classes in design-system.css. Nothing\nenforced that the two copies stay in sync — this is the CI-enforced guard\nagainst the failure mode this session was explicitly built to avoid\n(Angular Button and React Button silently drifting apart).\n\njsdom does not resolve CSS var() in getComputedStyle (verified directly\nbefore choosing this approach), so a computed-style test would silently\npass on divergent tokens. Instead this extracts the literal declaration\nlist for each rule from both sources and asserts they''re identical,\nproperty by property — a source-level guarantee that, given both consume\nthe same tokens.css, is stronger than a one-time visual check. It already\ncaught one real bug: a whitespace-normalization gap in the extractor itself\nthat a naive computed-style comparison would have masked.\n\nReal-browser verification (not checked in — jsdom limitation, not a repo\nartifact): rendered the actual Angular (TestBed) and React (RTL) output to\na static page with tokens.css + design-system.css, opened it in a real\nbrowser, and confirmed getComputedStyle resolves identically for both\nframeworks across all six components, in both light and dark themes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"becba44c04b3e353a6ea199ea2a5c6637cad1497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/becba44c04b3e353a6ea199ea2a5c6637cad1497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/db52290bbf9c702a0d25c226db704da24b601458","