ps://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c64d41d267493e5a6e4dcb4c99583479809859af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:32:17Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:32:17Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"docs(adr): correct ADR 0004''s CI-gate identity tier -- zone.js isn''t shipped, rxjs wasn''t verified\n\nThe identity tier listed @angular/*, zone.js, and rxjs together as if\nall three had equal evidence. Only @angular/* does (the NG0203 stack\ntrace). Checked the other two instead of leaving them by analogy:\n\n- zone.js isn''t in this app''s resolved dependency graph at all --\n  optional peer of @angular/core, absent from node_modules, absent\n  from both federation.config.js shared lists. This app is zoneless.\n  A gate asserting exact-match on a package that isn''t shipped guards\n  nothing. Removed from the tier.\n- rxjs''s \"instanceof fails across copies\" claim was asserted by\n  analogy to the Angular finding, not tested. Checked rxjs''s own\n  isObservable() source: it already falls back to duck-typing\n  (isFunction(obj.lift) && isFunction(obj.subscribe)) specifically to\n  survive multi-copy scenarios, which cuts against the assumption.\n  Kept in the exact-match tier as a precaution -- it''s still a shared\n  singleton in federation.config.js -- but relabeled \"exact-match by\n  precaution, not demonstrated\" rather than stated as fact.","tree":{"sha":"6496cc795bb0802ceb87a5465a82c8146b000d91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/6496cc795bb0802ceb87a5465a82c8146b000d91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/c64d41d267493e5a6e4dcb4c99583479809859af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/c64d41d267493e5a6e4dcb4c99583479809859af","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGM2NGQ0MWQyNjc0OTNlNWE2ZTRkY2I0Yzk5NTgzNDc5ODA5ODU5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2","sha":"321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2"}],"sha":"c64d41d267493e5a6e4dcb4c99583479809859af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c64d41d267493e5a6e4dcb4c99583479809859af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:23:50Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:23:50Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"chore(launch): add production-static launch configs, fix SPA-fallback\n\nStatic-serve configs for shell and remote-monitoring (dist/, real\nseparate origins, CORS enabled) used to verify federation across\ngenuinely built artifacts rather than dev servers -- see ADR 0004.\nremote-monitoring-drifted points at a sibling worktree''s build for\nre-running the version-drift experiment.\n\nAll three pass -s (serve''s SPA-fallback flag): a hard reload or direct\nlink to a client-side route (e.g. /monitoring) was 404ing instead of\nfalling back to index.html, since serve has no rewrite rule by\ndefault. Caught during the ADR 0004 investigation, unrelated to its\nmain finding but real -- fixed here.","tree":{"sha":"78988950ece4799891a73f1b9c5944f1e05b79b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/78988950ece4799891a73f1b9c5944f1e05b79b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDMyMTkxMGRkYzcxYmE2NDQ0MjljNGViNmMzYzY2MDU3MTRjOTdjZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3","sha":"c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3"}],"sha":"321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/321910ddc71ba644429c4eb6c3c6605714c97cf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:21:53Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:21:53Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"docs(adr): strictVersion is unenforced at runtime; ESM mount for React remote (ADR 0004)\n\nVerified, not inferred: read @softarc/native-federation-runtime''s\nresolution source (dedup keys on resolved version, never on\nrequiredVersion/strictVersion -- neither is read anywhere in the\npackage), then reproduced the consequence in a real production build\nserved from a separate git worktree with @angular/core independently\nresolved one patch version apart (21.2.18 vs the host''s 21.2.17 --\nboth satisfy the declared ~21.2.0 range). Result was neither silent\nreuse nor clean isolated coexistence: a hard NG0203 DI failure on\nfirst mount, with no fallback UI, because Angular''s injection context\nis module-scoped state and two ESM copies of @angular/core don''t\ninteroperate regardless of semver compatibility.\n\nDecision: the React remote (remote-admin) gets a plain ESM\nmount()/unmount() boundary, not any federation protocol -- immune to\nthis failure by construction, since nothing is shared. The Angular\nfederation pair keeps Native Federation, backed by a build-time CI\ngate (not yet implemented) that classifies shared dependencies by\nruntime identity -- exact-version match for framework singletons,\nsemver range for everything else -- since no runtime gate exists to\nreplace.\n\nADR 0003 (adr-react-remote-federation-interop.md) is superseded by\nthis decision for the specific question it left open (\"remote-admin''s\nfederation strategy is now open again\"); its protocol-incompatibility\nfinding stands as history. Renumbered docs/adr/*.md into a real\nsequence (0001-0004) so an ADR index can sort and link them.","tree":{"sha":"2dcd4029cac9a379eb5d46ccf6c67904462874dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/2dcd4029cac9a379eb5d46ccf6c67904462874dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGM5ZjY3ODk5N2YzMWFmMWU1M2IxMDRjMTVmMWJlNmM0NWEyMDlmZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1","sha":"eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1"}],"sha":"c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/c9f678997f31af1e53b104c15f1be6c45a209fe3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:55:59Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:55:59Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"refactor(remote-admin): swap Team Admin''s placeholder UI for @atlas/design-system\n\nButton, SearchInput, Badge, and useAnnounce() were built as documented\nplaceholders (\"swap for the shared DS X once it ships\") pending Day 6''s\ndesign-system package -- that package now exists, so this retrofits\nTeam Admin onto it. RoleBadge/StatusBadge stay local (they''re\nTeam-Admin-specific tone mappings, not generic DS components) but now\nwrap the real Badge.\n\nteam-admin.css drops its --ta-* placeholder token block entirely and\nmigrates every remaining rule (table, menu, drawer, dialog) onto the\nreal tokens.css custom properties; the Button/Badge/SearchInput/\nsr-only rules it used to define are gone since those visuals now come\nfrom the design-system package. Verified in the browser: real DS\nclasses and token colors are applied end-to-end, no regressions in the\nexisting Jest suite.","tree":{"sha":"b142e9ef81303ffac18bc0282b7464eece670152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/b142e9ef81303ffac18bc0282b7464eece670152"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGViMTJjYzI4OGFjYzNjNDFkNGY1MzBlOTZkNDFkYTZlNWRmODIwYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf","sha":"1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf"}],"sha":"eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/eb12cc288acc3c41d4f530e96d41da6e5df820b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:45:56Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:45:56Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"chore(remotes): consume design-system tokens\n\nImport tokens.css into each remote''s global stylesheet so both\nframeworks render identically off the same palette/spacing/type\nscale. Standalone dev-server previews (remote-monitoring, remote-admin)\ndefault data-theme to dark directly in their own index.html, since\nthat HTML document is never loaded when federated into the shell.","tree":{"sha":"3af349ae5d44f31d48df3e9f3b21f4f360936b16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/3af349ae5d44f31d48df3e9f3b21f4f360936b16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDFmZjIzNTA5MDlkZTllODZiYmExNGE3NTMwODkzNDg2Njk4YmIwY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990","sha":"7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990"}],"sha":"1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/1ff2350909de9e86bba14a7530893486698bb0cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:45:47Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:45:47Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(shell): wire theme bootstrap and FocusManager into the host\n\nInline pre-Angular script sets data-theme on <html> (dark default,\nprefers-color-scheme on first visit, localStorage thereafter) to avoid\na flash of the wrong theme. App now imports tokens.css, drops the\nleftover Nx-welcome scaffold, mounts <ds-live-region> once at the\nroot, and moves focus to the activated route''s data-remote-heading via\nrouter-outlet''s (activate) + afterNextRender.\n\nDeliberately does not also announce \"<remote> loaded\" from the host --\nTeam Admin and Resource Monitoring already own that announcement\nthemselves, and firing it from both places would double-announce to\nscreen reader users. The host''s FocusManager is focus-only.","tree":{"sha":"ee6298da30a36095735e2b740c5edd425424bfa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/ee6298da30a36095735e2b740c5edd425424bfa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKDczNzJmMThlNTg3Y2IyY2RjYzk1NDlkZWM5NTBlMjAxZDFkYzg5OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/d8e21f0fe79117ac5c818c95d87086f2390dae27","sha":"d8e21f0fe79117ac5c818c95d87086f2390dae27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/d8e21f0fe79117ac5c818c95d87086f2390dae27"}],"sha":"7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/7372f18e587cb2cdcc9549dec950e201d1dc8990"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/commits/d8e21f0fe79117ac5c818c95d87086f2390dae27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:45:37Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:45:37Z","email":"adithibalaji03@gmail.com","name":"Adithi Balaji"},"message":"feat(design-system): build §0 cross-boundary a11y foundation (Day 6)\n\ntokens.css (light/dark, spacing/radii/type scale, locked per\natlas-ui-implementation-spec.md §0.1/§0.4), split into separate\nangular/ and react/ subpath entry points so each app''s bundler only\never touches its own framework''s component code.\n\nAngular: LiveRegionService + <ds-live-region> (the host''s one\naria-live node) and FocusManager (moves focus to a mounted remote''s\ndata-remote-heading contract). React: useAnnounce() hook reading the\nsame window.__atlasLiveRegion__ bridge LiveRegionService publishes,\nsince the React remote has no Angular DI to reach the service\ndirectly.\n\nMVP-tier component set only (Button, StatusDot, Badge, Skeleton,\nSearchInput) -- Card/Panel/Icon/MetricTile/Select and the full\nTopBar/SideNav shell chrome are deferred until a built screen actually\nneeds them, per this session''s scope call.\n\nUnit tests cover LiveRegionService and FocusManager directly (the\n\"interview centerpiece\" pieces); the five presentational components\nare verified visually rather than via TestBed, since wiring\njest-preset-angular''s full component-render harness into this\npackage''s plain ts-jest setup was out of scope for the day.","tree":{"sha":"bf825e4decb13a71cd76965f33f0c860af313ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/trees/bf825e4decb13a71cd76965f33f0c860af313ed4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adithiB/atlas/git/commits/d8e21f0fe79117ac5c818c95d87086f2390dae27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83456549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB","id":83456549,"login":"adithiB","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDU2NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithiB","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adithiB/atlas/commit/d8e21f0fe79117ac5c818c95d87086f2390dae27","node_id":"C_kwDOTKuufNoAKGQ4ZTIxZjBmZ