and reads video.duration from the browser — 114 videos captured with\n  real durations (4.5–9 min each, totalling 11.9 h)\n- compute-times.mjs derives reading time from word count (200 wpm, strips code\n  blocks and HTML) and joins with scraped durations; outputs content-times.json\n- DocItem/Content swizzle injects [glasses] N min read / [eye] N min watch\n  badges on every doc page, server-side rendered via Docusaurus SSR\n- Home page (EN + PT-BR) shows total course stats under the hero subtitle:\n  7 h 26 min reading · 11 h 53 min watching\n- npm run build now runs compute-times.mjs before docusaurus build so data\n  stays in sync with content on every deploy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f48a51f83ccb4fefdf63f894c1df3795fb75a6cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ms-ciandt/trilha-react-native/git/trees/f48a51f83ccb4fefdf63f894c1df3795fb75a6cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ms-ciandt/trilha-react-native/git/commits/6c2b03e21cf0158f8d0fa4b23bab03597bb32b9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287799019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gbonin-ciandt","id":287799019,"login":"gbonin-ciandt","node_id":"U_kgDOESd26w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gbonin-ciandt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use